<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Revised Susu Gospels</book>
  <para style="h">Yaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Inyila Isa Annabi Yaya naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaya</para>
  <para style="mt">Inyila Isa Annabi Yaya naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitaabui naxan xili «Inyila Isa,» a dɔxɔ naani na a ra. Namiɲɔnmɛ naani nan Inyila Isa xa taruxui sɛbɛ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra. E xili nɛ Matiyu, Maraki, Luki, nun Yaya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Matiyu, Annabi Maraki, nun Annabi Luki, e Inyila Isa naxan sɛbɛ, e maniya e boore ra. Na saxanyi findixi taruxui nan na, naxan Isa bari ki, a ɲɛrɛ ki, nun a faxa ki masenma won bɛ. Inyila Isa Annabi Yaya naxan sɛbɛ, na fan Isa xa taruxui masenma, kɔnɔ kawandi nan gbo a kui. A Isa nan xa fe tagi rabama, alako mixie xa a kolon a Isa findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi yati yati nan na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Yaya a masenma duniɲa birin bɛ a a lanma won xa la Isa ra, won xa danxaniya a ma. Na findima kisi nan na ibunadama bɛ, kisi naxan mu kanama abadan. Annabi Yaya mixi ralimaniyama yi Kitaabui kui alako e naxa siikɛ Ala xa laayidi xa fe ma. Isa findixi sɛrɛxɛ xungbe nan na naxan duniɲa xunsarama. Won xa na kolon, won xa la a ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inyila Isa Annabi Yaya naxan sɛbɛxi, a wama Isa tide nan masenfe won bɛ. A tali wɔyɛnyi gbegbe rawalima na falafe ra. A a falama a Isa findixi «ibunadama xa naiyalanyi ra.» A a masenma a Isa luxi nɛ alɔ «xurusee dɛmadonyi» danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ. A Isa misaalima «naadɛ» nun «kira» ra. Isa luxi alɔ «ye» nun «baloe» mixie bɛ. Isa munafanyi gbo adama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa won mali na kolonfe ra alako Isa xa fe xa lu won bɔɲɛ kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Inyila Isa</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Yaya naxan sɛbɛxi</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ala Xui findife ibunadama ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />A fɔlɔ fɔlɛ, Ala Xui nu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Ala Xui nu na e nun Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Ala Xui nu findixi Ala yɛtɛ kan nan na.<verse eid="JHN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kabi a fɔlɛ, Ala nun a Xui nan nu a ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ala se birin daaxi a tan nan saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">sese mu na naxan mu daaxi a tan saabui ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Marakisi sɔtɔma a tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:4">kisi naxan findixi naiyalanyi ra adamadie bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Na naiyalanyi yanbama dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:5">dimi fan mu tin a ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ala naxa xɛmɛ nde xɛɛ, naxan nu xili Yaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Seede nan nu a ra, naxan fa seedeɲɔxɔya bade na naiyalanyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:7">alako birin xa danxaniya a saabui ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />A tan xa mu findixi na naiyalanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:8">kɔnɔ a tan fa nɛ a xa seede ba na naiyalanyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Naxan findixi naiyalanyi ra, naiyalanyi yati na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:9">naxan fama duniɲa ma, a xa adamadie birin iyalan.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ala Xui naxa sabati duniɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">Duniɲa daa a tan nan saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">kɔnɔ duniɲa tondi nɛ a kolonde.<verse eid="JHN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />A fa nɛ a xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:11">kɔnɔ a xa mixie mu a rasɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kɔnɔ naxan tan birin a rasɛnɛ, e danxaniya a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">a naxa nɔɛ fi nee tan ma, e xa findi Ala xa die ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Na mu keli e bɔnsɔɛ xa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">xa na mu fate bɛndɛ waxɔnyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">xa na mu mixi nde waxɔnyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">Ala yɛtɛ nan a niya e xa bari a nɛɛnɛ ra, e findi a xa die ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ala Xui naxa findi ibunadama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">a sabati muxu ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">Muxu bara a xa nɔrɛ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">a Baba nɔrɛ naxan fixi a xa Di kerenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">hinnɛnteya nun nɔndi kamalixi naxan yi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yaya naxa a xui ite, a seedeɲɔxɔya ba a xa fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">«N yi nan ma fe masen wo bɛ, n to a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">‹Naxan fama n xanbi ra, a tide gbo n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">barima beenun n tan xa daa, a tan nu na.›»<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Won birin bara hinnɛ sɔtɔ a saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:16">A xa hinnɛ bara gbo yɛ won yi ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ala sɛriyɛ Kitaabui fi won ma Annabi Munsa nan saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">A xa hinnɛ nun nɔndi tan faxi won ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">a xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa nan saabui ra.<verse eid="JHN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Adama yo mu na naxan bara Ala to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">kɔnɔ Ala xa Di kerenyi, naxan na a Baba Ala fɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">a tan bara a masen.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Yaya xa seedeɲɔxɔya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matiyu 3:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maraki 1:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luki 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yaya xa seedeɲɔxɔya nan ya. Darisalamu Yuwifi kuntigie naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi di ndee xɛɛ Yaya xɔn ma, e xa a maxɔrin, «Nde i tan na?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yaya mu tondi e yaabide, a naxa a masen e bɛ a fiixɛ ra, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi mu n tan xa ra.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />E man naxa a maxɔrin, «I fa findixi nde ra? Annabi Eliya nan na i ra?» Yaya naxa e yaabi, «Ade, Eliya mu n na.» E naxa a maxɔrin, «Namiɲɔnmɛ nan i ra muxu naxan mamɛfe a xa fa?» Yaya naxa e yaabi, «Ade.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Na kui, e naxa gbilen a maxɔrin na, «Nde i ra? I i yɛtɛ maɲɔxunxi nde ra? A yaba muxu bɛ, muxu xa sa dɛntɛgɛ sa muxu xɛɛmae bɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yaya naxa a masen e bɛ alɔ a sɛbɛxi Annabi Esayi xa Kitaabui kui ki naxɛ, «N tan findixi mixi nan na naxan a xui itema gbengberenyi ma, ‹Wo kira matinxin Marigi bɛ!›»<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Farisɛni nde naxee nu bara xɛɛ Yaya xɔn, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />e naxa a maxɔrin, «Xa i mu findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, i mu findixi Eliya ra, i mu findixi namiɲɔnmɛ ra muxu naxan mamɛfe, i fa mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra munfe ra?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yaya naxa e yaabi, «N tan mixie xunxama ye nan xɔɔra, kɔnɔ mixi keren na wo ya ma, wo mu naxan kolon. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Na nan fama n xanbi ra. Na binyɛ mu na n tan yi ra, n ɲan xa a xa sankiri luuti yati fulun.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Na fe birin dangi Betani nɛ, Yurudɛn xure naakiri ma, Yaya nu mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nan na Ala xa sɛrɛxɛ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matiyu 3:13-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maraki 1:9-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luki 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Na kuye iba, Yaya naxa Isa to fa ra a yire, a naxa a masen, «Ala xa sɛrɛxɛ nan yi ki, duniɲa xa yunubi xafarima naxan na. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />N nu yi nan ma fe masenfe wo bɛ n to a fala, n naxɛ, ‹Xɛmɛ naxan fama n xanbi ra, a tide gbo n bɛ, barima beenun n tan xa daa, a tan nu na.› <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />N tan yati mu nu na kanyi kolon, kɔnɔ n fa mixie xunxade ye xɔɔra nɛ alako a tan xa makɛnɛn Isirayilakae bɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yaya naxa seedeɲɔxɔya ba, a a masen, «N bara Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to goro ra kelife koore ma alɔ ganbɛ, a dɔxɔ a ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />N tan yati mu nu a kolon, kɔnɔ Ala naxan n xɛɛ mixie xunxade ye xɔɔra, a nu bara a masen n bɛ, ‹I n Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi toma goro ra naxan ma, a lu a ma, na kanyi nan n Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoroma mixie ma.› <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />N tan bara a to. N bara findi seede ra a Ala xa Di nan a ra.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa fɔxirabirɛ singee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Na kuye iba, Yaya man nu na naa, a nun a fɔxirabirɛ mixi firin. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yaya to Isa to dangi ra, a naxa a masen, «Ala xa sɛrɛxɛ nan yi ki!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />A fɔxirabirɛ firinyie to a xui mɛ, e naxa bira Isa fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Isa to a kobe rato, a naxa e to a fɔxɔ ra, a naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo munse fenfe?» E fan naxa a yaabi, «Rabuni, i yigiyaxi minden?» E to a xili «Rabuni», na nan falaxi e xa xui «Karamɔxɔ». <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Won xɛɛ, wo xa sa na kolon.» Nunmare tɛmui nan nu a ra. E naxa siga na yire kolonde, e fa lu Isa fɛ ma.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Simɔn Piyɛri xunya Andire nu na na mixi firinyie ya ma, naxee Yaya xa masenyi mɛ, e fa bira Isa fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />A naxa siga a taara yire keren na, a a fala a bɛ, «Muxu bara Al Masiihu to!» Na nan falaxi e xa xui, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi». <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andire naxa Piyɛri xanin Isa yire. Isa to a to, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yunusa xa di Simɔn nan i ra, kɔnɔ i xili fama falade Kefasi, na nan na ki ‹Piyɛri,› naxan wama a falafe ‹fanye›.»<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Na kuye iba, Isa naxa natɛ tongo a xa siga Galile. A to Filipu to, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «Bira n fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipu, Andire, nun Piyɛri birin findi Betesayidakae nan na. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipu naxa siga Natanayɛli yire, a a fala a bɛ, «Mixi naxan ma fe falaxi Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabuie kui, muxu bara a to. Isa Nasarɛtika nan a ra, Yusufu xa di!» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayɛli naxa a maxɔrin, «Fe fanyi nde nɔma minide Nasarɛti?» Filipu naxa a yaabi, «Fa, i yɛtɛ yati xa a to.» <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Isa to Natanayɛli to fa ra, a naxa a fala a xa fe ra, «Isirayilaka yati nan yi ki, maifuya yo mu na naxan bɔɲɛ ma!» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayɛli naxa a maxɔrin, «I n kolonxi di?» Isa naxa a yaabi, «Beenun Filipu xa i xili, i to nu xɔrɛ bili bun ma, n tan i to nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanayɛli naxa a fala a bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, i tan findixi Ala xa Di yati nan na! Isirayila Mangɛ nan i ra!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N to a falaxi, a n i to nɛ xɔrɛ bili bun ma, i laxi n na na fe nan ma? I fe gbɛtɛe toma nɛ naxee dangi na ra.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />A man naxa a masen a bɛ, «N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, wo fama nɛ koore tode, a rabixi, Ala xa malekɛe nu te e nu goro Adama xa Di ma.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Futixiri xulunyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Na xi saxan nde ma, futixiri xulunyi nde naxa raba Kaana, naxan na Galile bɔxi ma. Isa nga nu na na xulun mixie ya ma. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Isa fan nu xilixi naa, a nun a fɔxirabirɛe. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Wɛni to ɲɔn, Isa nga naxa a fala a bɛ, «Wɛni bara ɲɔn yi mixie yi ra.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Isa naxa a maxɔrin, «N nga, i wama munse xɔn ma n na? N ma waxati mu nu a li sinden.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />A nga naxa a fala banxi konyie bɛ, «A na naxan yo fala wo bɛ, wo a raba.»<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Fɛɲɛ senni gɛmɛ daaxi nu na mɛnni, naxee rafema ye ra Yuwifie e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛnma naxan na. Litiri tongo solomasaxan han litiri kɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nu nɔma sade fɛɲɛ keren kui. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Isa naxa a fala konyie bɛ, «Wo yi fɛɲɛe rafe ye ra.» E naxa e birin nafe tapu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />A man naxa a fala e bɛ, «Yakɔsi, wo a nde ba, wo a xanin xulun xunyi xɔn ma.» E naxa na fan naba. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Xulun xunyi to na ye min Isa nu bara naxan mafindi wɛni ra, a mu nu a kelide kolon, kɔnɔ konyi naxee ye baxi, nee tan a kolon. A to a min, a naxa ginɛfenyi xili, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />a a fala a bɛ, «Xulun kanyi birin wɛni fanyi nan singe raminima, mixie na siisi, e fa wɛni gbɛtɛ ramini. Kɔnɔ i tan bara wɛni fanyi ragata han yi tɛmui!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Na naxa findi Isa xa tɔnxuma singe ra. A a raba Kaana nɛ, Galile bɔxi ma. Na fe kui, a a xa nɔrɛ nan makɛnɛn, a fɔxirabirɛe naxa la a ra.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Na xanbi, a naxa sa goro Kapɛrɛnamu, a nun a nga, a xunyae, nun a fɔxirabirɛe. E naxa sa xi ndee radangi naa.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa yulɛe kerife hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matiyu 21:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maraki 11:15-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luki 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Yuwifie xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali to makɔrɛ, Isa naxa te Darisalamu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />A naxa sa li, ninge, yɛxɛɛ, nun ganbɛ matie nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire, kɔbiri masarɛe fan nu dɔxɔxi naa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Isa naxa luuti ndee yailan luxusinyi ra, a yulɛe birin keri hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a nun e xa ningee nun yɛxɛɛe. A naxa kɔbiri masarɛe xa kɔbiri rayensen bɔxi, a e xa teebilie rabira. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />A naxa a fala ganbɛ matie fan bɛ, «Wo yee tongo be! Wo ba n Baba xa banxi findife makiti ra!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa ratu na Kitaabui sɛbɛli ma naxan a falama, «Xanunteya bara gbo yɛ n bɔɲɛ kui i xa banxi xa fe ra.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Na kui, Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a maxɔrin, «I tɔnxuma makaabaxi mundun nabama naxan a masenma muxu bɛ a a lan i xa yi mɔɔli raba?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabira. Xi saxan bun ma n tan a rakelima.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a fala, «Yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi naxan tixi ɲɛ tongo naani nun senni bun ma, i tan na rakelima nɛ xi saxan bun ma?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kɔnɔ Isa to hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe fala, taali wɔyɛnyi nan nu a ra. A nu a fate nan ma fe falafe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />A to keli faxɛ ma, a fɔxirabirɛe naxa ratu a xa wɔyɛnyi ma. Na kui, e naxa la Kitaabui xui ra, e naxa la Isa xui ra.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Isa to nu na Darisalamu, Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali waxati, mixi gbegbe naxa danxaniya a ma e to tɔnxuma makaabaxie to, a nu naxee rabama. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Kɔnɔ Isa mu nu lama e ra, barima a nu adamadi birin kolon. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />A hayi yo mu nu a ma, mixi yo xa ibunadama xa fe fala a bɛ, barima a tan nu adamadi bɔɲɛ kolon.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Isa nun Nikodemu xa sumunyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Yuwifi kuntigi nde nu na Farisɛnie ya ma, naxan xili Nikodemu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />A naxa siga Isa xɔn ma kɔɛ ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, muxu a kolon karamɔxɔ nan i ra Ala naxan xɛɛxi. I tɔnxuma makaabaxi naxee rabafe, mixi yo mu nɔma e rabade xa a kanyi nun Ala xa mu a ra.»<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «N xa nɔndi yati fala i bɛ, xa mixi mu bari a nɛɛnɛ ra, a mu nɔma sode Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu naxa a maxɔrin, «Mixi mɔxi nɔma gbilende a nga tɛɛgɛ, a man gbilen bari ra?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «A nɔndi i ma n xa a fala i bɛ, xa mixi mu bari a nɛɛnɛ ra, ye nun Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, a mu nɔma sode Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma.»<verse eid="JHN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />«Fate bɛndɛ nan mixi fate bɛndɛ barima. Kɔnɔ mixi xaxili tan barima Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />N to a falaxi i bɛ a fo wo xa bari a nɛɛnɛ ra, na naxa i tɛrɛnna. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Foye minima a na wa minife dɛdɛ biri ra. I a xui nan mɛma, kɔnɔ i mu a kelide kolon, i mu a sigade fan kolon. Mixi na bari a nɛɛnɛ ra Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, a luma na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu naxa a maxɔrin, «Na rabama di?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tan naxan findixi Isirayila karamɔxɔ xungbe ra, i mu na kolon? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />N xa nɔndi yati fala i bɛ, muxu fee nan falama muxu naxee kolon. Muxu man fee nan seede bama muxu naxee toxi, kɔnɔ wo bara tondi muxu xa seedeɲɔxɔya ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Xa wo mu la n xui ra, n to yi duniɲa fee falafe wo bɛ, xa n sa ariyanna fee nan fala wo bɛ, wo lama a ra di? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Mixi yo mu nu te ariyanna, fo Adama xa Di naxan kelixi ariyanna.»<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />«Annabi Munsa to nu na gbengberenyi ma, a naxa bɔximase misaali nde yailan wure gbeeli ra, a a ite wuri kuye ma. Adama xa Di fan lanma a xa ite wuri kɔn na na ki nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />alako naxan yo danxaniya a ma, na kanyi xa kisi sɔtɔ naxan mu ɲɔnma abadan. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ala duniɲa xanu nɛ han a naxa a xa Di kerenyi fi, alako mixi yo naxan na danxaniya a ma, a naxa lɔɛ, a xa kisi nɛ abadan. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ala mu a xa Di xɛɛ duniɲa xa ratɔnde, a a xɛɛ nɛ a xa fa duniɲa rakisi. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Naxan yo na danxaniya a ma, kiiti mu kanama na kanyi ra, kɔnɔ naxan yo mu danxaniya a ma, kiiti ɲan bara gɛ kanade na kanyi ra, barima a mu danxaniyaxi Ala xa Di kerenyi ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Kiiti nan ya: Ala xa naiyalanyi bara fa duniɲa, kɔnɔ dimi rafan adamadie ma dangi na naiyalanyi ra, barima e kɛwali mu fan. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Naiyalanyi mu rafan fe kobi raba yo ma. E mu minima naiyalanyi ma, e xa wali kobie naxa fa sa kɛnɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kɔnɔ naxan yo ɲɛrɛma Ala xa nɔndi ma, a tan minima naiyalanyi ma, alako Ala waxɔnfe e naxan nabafe, na xa sa kɛnɛ ma.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Yaya seede bafe Isa xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Na xanbi, Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe naxa keli Darisalamu e so Yudaya bɔxi ma. Isa naxa waxati nde raba mɛnni a nun a fɔxirabirɛe, e nu mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yaya fan nu mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra Enon nɛ, Salimon fɛ ma, barima ye gbegbe nu na naa. Mixie nu sigama a xɔn, a tan nu e xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />A a lixi na tɛmui, a mu nu saxi geeli sinden.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Lɔxɔ nde, wɔyɛnyi naxa mini Yaya fɔxirabirɛe nun Yuwifi nde tagi marasɛniyɛnyi xa fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />E naxa siga Yaya yire, e a fala a bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, wo nun xɛmɛ naxan nu a ra Yurudɛn naakiri ma, i bara naxan ma fe seede ba, a na mixie xunxafe ye xɔɔra. Birin na sigafe a yire.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yaya naxa e yaabi, «Mixi mu fefe sɔtɔma, fo Ala na naxan fi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Wo tan yati bara findi n ma seedee ra, a n a masen nɛ, ‹N tan xa mu findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra. N xɛɛxi a ya ra nɛ.› <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Xɛmɛ naxan ginɛ fenxi, a tan nan findima ginɛ kanyi ra. A dɛfanboore tan luma a fɛ ma nɛ, a a tuli mati a ra ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. N tan luma na ki nɛ Isa bɛ. N ma sɛɛwɛ bara kamali. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Fo Isa xa fe xa ite nɛ, n gbe xa igoro.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Naxan kelixi koore, a tan dangi birin na. Naxan kelixi duniɲa ma, duniɲa mixi nan a ra naxan wɔyɛnma a duniɲa ki ma, kɔnɔ naxan tan kelixi ariyanna, a tan dangi birin na. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />A tan fe nan seede bama, a bara naxan to, a man bara naxan mɛ, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu lama a xa seedeɲɔxɔya ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mixi naxan lama na seedeɲɔxɔya ra, a bara a kolon a Ala nɔndi nan falama. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ala xa Xɛɛra Ala xa masenyi nan tima, barima a kamalixi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Baba Ala a xa Di xanuxi nɛ, a fe birin sa a bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Naxan na danxaniya Ala xa Di ma, a bara abadan kisi sɔtɔ. Kɔnɔ naxan na Ala xa Di xui matandi, na kanyi tan mu kisima. Ala xa xɔnɛ nan birama a fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Samari ginɛ nde nun Samarikae danxaniyafe Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Isa naxa a kolon a Farisɛnie bara a mɛ, a fɔxirabirɛe na wuyafe, a man na mixie xunxafe ye xɔɔra dangi Yaya ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Kɔnɔ a fa li Isa yɛtɛ xa mu nu mixie xunxama ye xɔɔra, a fɔxirabirɛe nan nu a rabama. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Isa to rakolon na fe ma, a naxa keli Yudaya, a gbilen Galile bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Na biyaasi kui, a nu lan a xa Samari bɔxi igiri sigafe ra Galile. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />A naxa Samari taa nde li naxan xili Sukaru, dɛnnaxɛ makɔrɛ xɛ ra, Yuwifie benba Yaxuba naxan fi a xa di Yusufu ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Yaxuba xa kɔlɔnyi na mɛnni nɛ. Isa to nu bara tagan a xa biyaasi kui, a naxa a magoro na kɔlɔn dɛ ra. Yanyi tagi nan nu a ra.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Samari ginɛ nde to fa ye bade, Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ki ye, n xa a min.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />A a lixi Isa fɔxirabirɛe nu bara siga donse sarade taa kui. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ginɛ naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «I tan Yuwifi, n tan Samari ginɛ. I n maxɔrinma ye min daaxi ma munfe ra?» Ginɛ na fala nɛ barima Yuwifie nun Samarikae mu sese masarama e bore tagi. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Isa naxa a fala, «Xa i sa a kolon nu, Ala wama i kife naxan na, i tan nan a makulama kisi ye ra nu, a fa na fi i ma. Xa i sa a kolon nu mixi naxan a falafe i bɛ yi ki, ‹n ki ye ra,› i tan fan a makulama nɛ ye ra nu naxan i rakisima.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ginɛ naxa a maxɔrin, «N ba, ye base yo mu i yi ra, yi kɔlɔnyi fan tilin. I fa na kisi ye sɔtɔma minden? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ka i tan dangi muxu benba Yaxuba ra? A tan nan yi kɔlɔnyi fi muxu ma. A tan yɛtɛ bara a ye min, a nun a xa die, a nun a xa gɔɔrɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Naxan yo yi kɔlɔn ye min, ye xɔli man gbilenma a suxu ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Kɔnɔ naxan ye minma n naxan fima a ma, ye xɔli mu a suxuma sɔnɔn. Na ye findima dulonyi nan na a bɔɲɛ ma, a gbo a i, a findi abadan kisi ra.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ginɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ba, na ye fi n ma, alako ye xɔli naxa n suxu, n naxa fa ye bade sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Siga i sa i xa mɔri xili, wo fa be.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ginɛ naxa a yaabi, «N mu dɔxɔxi xɛmɛ xɔn.» Isa naxa a fala, «I nɔndi nan falaxi, a i mu dɔxɔxi xɛmɛ xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />I bara dɔxɔ xɛmɛ suuli birin xɔn ma, i man nun xɛmɛ naxan a ra yi tɛmui, futi mu wo tagi. Na tan, i nɔndi nan falaxi.»<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ginɛ naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Awa, n bara a kolon fa, a namiɲɔnmɛ nan na i ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Muxu benbae Ala batu yi geya nan fari, kɔnɔ wo tan Yuwifie a falama a fo Ala xa batu Darisalamu nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ma di, i xa la n na, waxati na fafe Baba Ala mu batuma yi geya ma, a mu batuma Darisalamu fan. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Wo tan Samarikae, wo salima, kɔnɔ wo mu Ala kolon. Muxu tan Yuwifie, muxu salima, muxu man Ala kolon, barima Ala xa kisi fatanma Yuwifie nan na. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kɔnɔ waxati na fafe, a ɲan bara a li, Baba Ala batulae a batuma a nɔndi ki ma e xaxili fiixɛ nan na. Baba Ala wama na batula mɔɔlie nan xɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ala findixi Xaxili nan na. A batulae lan nɛ e xa a batu e xaxili fiixɛ nan na a nɔndi ki ma.»<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ginɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «N a kolon a Al Masiihu fafe, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi. A tan na fa, a fe birin tagi rabama nɛ won bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N tan nan na ra, n tan Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan wɔyɛnfe i bɛ yi ki.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe to Isa li, a na wɔyɛnfe na ginɛ ra, e dɛ naxa ixara, kɔnɔ e mu a maxɔrin, «I wama munse xɔn» xa na mu a ra «Wo na munse falafe?»<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ginɛ naxa a xa fɛɲɛ lu naa, a siga taa kui, a sa a fala mixie bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Wo fa. Wo xa xɛmɛ nde mato naxan bara n ma kɛwali birin fala n bɛ, a mu n kolon. Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi na a ra ba, ka?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Na kui, taakae naxa mini sigafe ra Isa yire.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Na waxati bun ma, Isa fɔxirabirɛe nu wɔyɛnfe a bɛ, e a fala, «Karamɔxɔ, i dɛge.» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Baloe na n tan yi ra, wo tan mu naxan kolon.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e bore maxɔrin, «Pe, mixi nde nan faxi donse ra a xɔn ma ba?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «N tan ma baloe findixi n Xɛɛma waxɔnfe rabafe nan na, n xa a xa wali rakamali a bara naxan so n yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Wo tan mu a falama xɛ, ‹Kike naani nan luxi beenun xɛ xabɛ xa a li›? N xa a fala wo bɛ, wo wo ya rasiga, wo xɛe mato, e ragbeelixi ki naxɛ. Xɛ xaba tɛmui bara a li. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Xɛ xabɛ ɲan bara a xa wali sare sɔtɔ fɔlɔ. A xa wali a niyama nɛ mixi xa kisi sɔtɔ abadan. Na kui, naxan xɛ bima nun naxan xɛ xabama, e birin luma sɛɛwɛ keren nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Yi masenyi findixi nɔndi nan na, ‹Mixi nde xɛ garansanma, gbɛtɛ a xabama.› <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />N tan wo xɛɛxi xɛ xabade nɛ, wo mu naxan nawalixi. Mixi gbɛtɛe nan walixi, kɔnɔ wo tan nan e xa wali raɲɔnyi toma.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Samarika naxee nu sabatixi na taa kui, e gbegbe naxa danxaniya Isa ma na ginɛ xa seedeɲɔxɔya xa fe ra, a to a fala, «N bara kɛwali naxan birin naba, a bara a birin tagi raba n bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Na kui, Samarikae to fa Isa yire, e naxa a mayandi a xa lu e xɔnyi. Isa naxa xi firin naba naa. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Mixi gbegbe man naxa danxaniya a xa masenyi saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />E naxa a fala na ginɛ bɛ, «Singe muxu nu danxaniyaxi i tan nan xa wɔyɛnyi xa fe ra, kɔnɔ yakɔsi muxu tan yɛtɛ bara a xui mɛ. Muxu bara a kolon fa, a yi findixi duniɲa rakisima nan yati ra.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xɛmɛ nde xa di rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Na xi firin dangi xanbi, Isa naxa keli naa, a siga Galile, <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />barima a tan yati a a masen nɛ a namiɲɔnmɛ sese yo mu binyama a xɔnyi. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />A to so Galile, naakae naxa a rasɛnɛ a fanyi ra, barima e fan nu bara Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba Darisalamu, e a xa kaabanakoe to, a naxee raba naa.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Na kui, Isa man naxa so Kaana, Galile bɔxi ma, a ye mafindi wɛni ra dɛnnaxɛ. Mangɛ xa walikɛ xungbe nde nu na naa, naxan xa di nu furaxi Kapɛrɛnamu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />A to a mɛ a Isa bara fa Galile kelife Yudaya, a naxa siga a yire, a a maxandi a xa fa a xa di xɛmɛ rayalan naxan nu saxi saya fure ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Wo tan mu danxaniyama feo, fo wo tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe to!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mangɛ xa walikɛ naxa a mayandi, «Marigi, talu n xɔnyi beenun n ma di xa faxa!» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Siga, i xa di bara kisi.» Na walikɛ naxa la Isa xa masenyi ra, a naxa siga. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />A nu na gbilenfe tɛmui naxɛ, a xa konyie naxa a ralan, e a fala a bɛ, «I xa di bara kisi!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />A fan naxa e maxɔrin, «A fisa mun tɛmui?» E naxa a yaabi, «A fate xinbelixi xoro yanyi tagi ɲɔndɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Na di baba naxa a kolon a xa di yalan fɔlɔ kabi Isa a fala a bɛ tɛmui naxɛ, «I xa di bara kisi.» Na nan a ra, na xɛmɛ nun a xa denbaya birin naxa danxaniya Isa ma.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Na naxa findi Isa xa tɔnxuma makaabaxi firin nde ra. A a raba Galile nɛ, a to gbilen kelife Yudaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Isa namatɛ rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Na dangi xanbi, Yuwifie xa sali nde to a li, Isa naxa te Darisalamu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ye yire nde nu na Darisalamu, naxan xili Beteseda Eburu xui. A nu na taa naadɛ xungbe nan fɛ ma, naxan xili Xurusee Naadɛ. Leele suuli nan nu na na ye yire. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4" />Furema wuyaxi nu saxi na leelee bun ma, alɔ dɔnxuie, namatɛe, nun naxee salonyie birin tuuxi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Xɛmɛ nde nu na naa, naxan nu namataxi kabi ɲɛ tongo saxan nun solomasaxan. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Isa to nu a kolon a yi xɛmɛ nu bara bu a namataxi ra, a to a saxi to, a naxa a maxɔrin, «I wama a xɔn i xa yalan?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Namatɛ naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, ye na imaxa, mixi yo mu na naxan n nagoroma a xɔɔra. Beenun n tan xa ye yire li, mixi gbɛtɛ bara goro a xɔɔra.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Keli, i i xa dagi tongo, i i ɲɛrɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />A naxa yalan keren na. A naxa a xa dagi tongo, a a ɲɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Na lɔxɔɛ to nu findixi malabu lɔxɔɛ nan na, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a fala na xɛmɛ rayalanxi bɛ, «Malabu lɔxɔɛ nan to, a mu lanma i xa i xa dagi xanin i xun.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Kɔnɔ a tan naxa e yaabi, «Xɛmɛ naxan n nayalanxi, na nan a fala n bɛ, ‹I i xa dagi tongo, i i ɲɛrɛ.›» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />E naxa a maxɔrin, «Nde na falaxi i bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kɔnɔ xɛmɛ mu nu a kolon naxan a rayalanxi, barima Isa nu bara lɔɛ a ma ɲama ya ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Na dangi xanbi, Isa man naxa na xɛmɛ li hɔrɔmɔbanxi, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yakɔsi i bara yalan, kɔnɔ a lanma i xa gbilen yunubi fɔxɔ ra alako fe gbɛtɛ naxa i sɔtɔ naxan dangi na fure singe ra.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Xɛmɛ naxa siga a sa a fala Yuwifi kuntigie bɛ, a Isa nan a rayalanxi.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Isa to na fe raba malabu lɔxɔɛ nɛ, Yuwifi kuntigie naxa so Isa gerefe. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Han to n Baba na walife, n fan na walife.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Na tɛmui, Yuwifie naxa fe birin naba alako e xa a faxa, barima a nu malabu lɔxɔɛ sɛriyɛ kanama, a man nu a falama a Ala nan a Baba ra. Na na a ra e birin tide lanxi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa Di walima a Baba nan xa yaamari ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Na kui, Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xa nɔndi yati fala wo bɛ, Ala xa Di mu nɔma fefe rabade a yɛtɛ ra, fo a na naxan to a Baba Ala ra. Ala xa Di, a Baba Ala nan fɔxi rabama. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Barima Baba Ala a xa Di xanuxi nɛ, a man fe naxan birin nabama, a a masenma a xa Di bɛ. A ɲan fama fee masende a bɛ naxee makaaba dangi yee ra, alako wo dɛ xa ixara. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Baba Ala mixie rakelima faxɛ ma ki naxɛ, a e rakisi, Ala xa Di fan kisi fima a na wa a fife naxee ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Baba Ala ɲan mu mixi yo makiitima, a mixi makiitife birin luxi a xa Di nan ma, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />alako birin xa Ala xa Di binya alɔ e Baba Ala binyama ki naxɛ. Naxan yo mu Ala xa Di binya, a mu Baba Ala fan binyaxi naxan a xa Di xɛɛxi duniɲa.»<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, naxan a tuli matima n na, a fa la n Xɛɛma ra, na kanyi bara kisi abadan. Na kanyi mu kiiti xɔrɔxɔɛ sɔtɔma, a bara gɛ ratangade yahannama ma, a bara kisi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, waxati fafe a lide, a ɲan bara a li, faxamixie Ala xa Di xui mɛma nɛ. Naxee na a xui mɛ, nee kisima nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Baba Ala to findixi kisi kanyi ra kisi sɔtɔma naxan na, a bara a xa Di fan findi kisi kanyi ra kisi sɔtɔma naxan na. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />A man bara nɔɛ so a yi ra adamadie makiitife ma, barima Adama xa Di nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Wo naxa kaaba yi fe ma, barima waxati fafe a lide, naxee na gaburi kui, e birin a xui mɛma nɛ, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />e mini e xa gaburie kui. Naxee findi fe fanyi rabae ra, nee na keli, e kisi nan sɔtɔma. Kɔnɔ naxee findi fe kobi rabae ra, nee tan na keli, e gbaloe nan sɔtɔma.»<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />«N tan mu nɔma fefe rabade n yɛtɛ ra. N a mɛma Baba Ala ra ki naxɛ, n tan kiiti sama na ki nɛ. Na kui, n ma kiiti tinxin, barima n mu birama n yɛtɛ waxɔnfe xa fɔxɔ ra, n biraxi n Xɛɛma nan waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Xa n sa seede ba n yɛtɛ bɛ, a mu lanma. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Baba Ala nan seede bama n bɛ. N fan a kolon a tan seedeɲɔxɔya naxan bama n ma fe ra, a findixi nɔndi nan na. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Wo tan yati bara mixie xɛɛ Yaya xɔn, a fan naxa seedeɲɔxɔya ba nɔndi xa fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />N hayi mu na adama tan xa seedeɲɔxɔya ma, kɔnɔ n yi fee masenxi nɛ wo bɛ alako wo xa kisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yaya nu luxi nɛ alɔ lanpui radɛxɛxi naxan yanbama. Wo bara sɛɛwa na naiyalanyi ra waxati nde bun ma.»<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />«Kɔnɔ seedeɲɔxɔya nde na n bɛ naxan dangi Yaya gbe ra. N fee naxee rabama, Baba Ala bara naxee so n yi n xa e raba, nee nan findixi seedeɲɔxɔya ra n ma fe ra, a Baba Ala nan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Baba Ala naxan n xɛɛxi, a fan yati bara seede ba n ma fe ra. Wo singe mu nu a xui mɛ, wo mu nu a yatagi to, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />a xa masenyi man mu sabatixi wo bɔɲɛ ma, barima wo mu laxi a xa xɛɛra ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Wo luma Kitaabuie mato ra, barima wo ɲɔxɔ a ma, a wo abadan kisi sɔtɔma e tan nan saabui ra. A fa li, na Kitaabuie yati nan n ma fe seede bama, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />kɔnɔ wo tondixi fade n ma wo xa kisi sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«N mu wama adamadie xa matɔxɔɛ xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />N wo kolon. Ala xa xanunteya mu na wo bɔɲɛ kui. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />N faxi n Baba nan xili ra, kɔnɔ wo mu n nasɛnɛxi. Xa mixi gbɛtɛ sa fa a yɛtɛ kan nan xili ra, wo mu tondima na tan nasɛnɛde. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Wo to wama wo xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ wo bore ra, kɔnɔ wo mu matɔxɔɛ fenma naxan fatanxi Ala Kerenyi tan na, wo fa danxaniyama di?»<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />«Wo naxa a maɲɔxun de a n tan nan wo kalamuma Baba Ala xɔn. Annabi Munsa, wo xaxili tixi naxan na, na nan wo kalamuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Xa wo sa laxi Munsa ra nu, wo lama nɛ n fan na nu, barima Munsa n tan nan ma fe sɛbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Kɔnɔ xa wo mu laxi a xa Kitaabui ra, wo fa lama n tan ma masenyi ra di?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Isa donse fife xɛmɛ mixi wulu suuli ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matiyu 14:13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maraki 6:30-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luki 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Na xanbi, Isa naxa giri Galile Baa naakiri ma, e naxan xili falama Tiberiyasi Baa. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ɲama gbegbe nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, barima e nu a xa tɔnxuma makaabaxie toxi, a nu naxee rabama furemae bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Isa naxa te geya fari, a sa dɔxɔ naa a nun a fɔxirabirɛe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Yuwifie xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali nu bara makɔrɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Isa to a ya rasiga, a naxa ɲama gbegbe to fa ra a yire, a naxa Filipu maxɔrin, «Won sa nɔma taami sarade minden alako yi mixi birin xa e dɛge?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />A na fala nɛ alako a xa Filipu mato, barima Isa ɲan nu a kolon a fafe naxan nabade. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipu naxa a yaabi, «Hali won taami sara xi kɛmɛ firin wali sare nan na, na mu a niyama yi ɲama mixi birin xa nɔ taami xuntundi sɔtɔde.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ Andire, Simɔn Piyɛri xunya, a naxa a fala, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Mɛngi taami suuli na yi xɛmɛ dimɛdi yi ra, a nun yɛxɛ firin, kɔnɔ na findixi munse ra yi ɲama bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Isa naxa a masen, «Wo a fala ɲama bɛ e xa e magoro.» Ɲooge xinde gbegbe to nu na naa, mixie naxa dɔxɔ bɔxi, e xɛmɛ mixi wulu suuli ɲɔndɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Na tɛmui, Isa naxa na taami suuli tongo, a Ala tantu, a e itaxun ɲama magoroxi ma, a a raba na ki nɛ yɛxɛ fan na. Birin naxa a sɔtɔ, han e birin naxa wasa. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ɲama to luga, Isa naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Wo donse dɔnxɔɛ xuntunyie malan, alako sese naxa makana.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Na kui, e naxa mixie xa donse dɔnxɔɛ xuntunyie malan han debe fu nun firin naxa rafe. Na birin fatan mɛngi taami gundi suuli nan na.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ɲama to Isa xa tɔnxuma makaabaxi to, e naxa a fala, «Muxu bara namiɲɔnmɛ naxan mamɛ a xa fa duniɲa ma, a tan nan yati yi ki!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Isa to a kolon a e nu fafe a suxude nɛ e xa a findi mangɛ ra, a naxa keli e xun ma, a sa lu a kerenyi ma geya fari.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ɲɛrɛfe ye fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nunmare to so, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa goro baa dɛ ra, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />e baki kunkui kui, e xa baa igiri sigafe ra Kapɛrɛnamu. Dimi nu bara sin, kɔnɔ Isa mu nu gbilen e yire sinden. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Foye belebele naxa mini, baa naxa xaaɲɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />E to laala ba kilo suuli xa na mu senni ɲɔndɔn, e naxa Isa to ɲɛrɛ ra ye fari, a fafe e mabiri kunkui yire. E naxa gaaxu. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «N tan nan a ra. Wo naxa gaaxu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />E to nu wama a xa te kunkui kui, kunkui naxa e sigade li keren na.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kisi taami naxan fatanxi Ala ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Kuye naxa iba ɲama ra baa dɛ, Isa fɔxirabirɛe kunkui tongo dɛnnaxɛ. E nu a kolon a na kunkui kerenyi nan nu na naa, a fa li Isa mu baki a kui, fo a fɔxirabirɛe doro. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kunkui gbɛtɛ naxee keli Tiberiyasi, nee naxa e li mɛnni, e taami don dɛnnaxɛ, Marigi naxan so e yi a to gɛ Ala tantude. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Mixie to a kolon a Isa mu nu na mɛnni sɔnɔn, a fɔxirabirɛe fan mu na, e fan naxa baki kunkuie kui, e giri Kapɛrɛnamu, Isa fende.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />E to Isa li baa naakiri ma, e naxa a maxɔrin, «Karamɔxɔ, i faxi be mun tɛmui?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «A nɔndi ki ma n xa a fala wo bɛ, wo mu n fenfe xɛ n to tɔnxuma makaabaxi raba wo ya xɔri. Wo n fenfe nɛ wo to lugaxi taami ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Wo naxa wali duniɲa baloe xa fe ra, naxan bɔrɔma. Wo xa wali baloe nan ma fe ra naxan buma, a abadan kisi fi wo ma. Adama xa Di nan na baloe fima wo ma, barima Baba Ala bara a tan nan matɔnxuma a xa Mixi Sugandixi ra.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Na kui, ɲama naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Muxu lanma muxu xa munse raba alako muxu xa nu kɛwalie raba Ala wama naxee xɔn?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Ala wama kɛwali naxan xɔn, a findixi yi nan na: Wo xa danxaniya a xa xɛɛra ma.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />E man naxa a maxɔrin, «I tɔnxuma makaabaxi mundun nabama muxu ya xɔri alako muxu xa la i ra? I fa kɛwali mundun nabama? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Muxu benbae taami nde don nɛ gbengberenyi ma naxan goro kelife koore ma. A sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, ‹Ala naxa taami fi e ma baloe ra, naxan keli koore ma.›» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Isa man naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xa a masen wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, Annabi Munsa mu koore taami fi wo ma. N Baba nan koore taami yati fima wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Barima taami naxan fatanxi Ala ra, a tan nan goroma keli koore, a kisi fi duniɲa ma.»<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Na kui, e naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, muxu ki na taami ra tɛmui birin.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N tan nan na kisi taami ra. Naxan na fa n tan ma, a mu kaamɛ kolonma abadan. Naxan na danxaniya n tan ma, a mu ye xɔli kolonma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kɔnɔ alɔ n a falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, hali wo to bara n to, wo mu laxi n na. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Baba Ala mixi naxan birin fima n ma, a fama nɛ n ma, n mu mɛɛma e ra abadan, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />barima n kelixi koore ma n Xɛɛma waxɔnfe nan nabade. N mu faxi n yɛtɛ waxɔnfe xa rabade. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />N Xɛɛma wama nɛ n xa a xa mixi birin nakeli faxɛ ma lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ. A mixi naxee fixi n ma, hali keren naxa lɔɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Na nan findixi n Baba sagoe ra, a naxan yo na danxaniya a xa Di ma, na kanyi xa abadan kisi sɔtɔ, n man xa a rakeli faxɛ ma lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ ma.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Na kui, Yuwifie naxa so a mafalafe, barima a nu bara a fala, «N tan nan na taami ra naxan goro keli koore.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />E nu a falama nɛ, e naxɛ, «Isa xa mu yi ki, Yusufu xa di? Won mu a nga nun a baba kolon? A fa a falama di, a a goroxi nɛ keli koore?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo ba wɔyɛnfe wo bore tagi na mɔɔli ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Mixi yo mu nɔma fade n ma, xa Baba Ala, naxan n xɛɛxi, mu a kanyi mabɛndun n ma. N fan fama a kanyi rakelide faxɛ ma lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />A sɛbɛxi namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabui kui, ‹Ala fama nɛ e birin xarande.› Naxan yo na Baba Ala xui ramɛ, a a xa masenyi suxu, na kanyi tan fama nɛ n ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Mixi yo mu na naxan bara Baba Ala to, bafe mixi ra naxan fatanxi Ala ra. Na keren nan bara Baba Ala to.»<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />«N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, naxan na danxaniya n ma, a bara abadan kisi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />N tan nan na kisi taami ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Wo benbae taami don nɛ gbengberenyi ma, kɔnɔ e birin naxa faxa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Taami naxan goroxi keli koore, a na be. Naxan yo na yi tan don, na kanyi mu faxama. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />N tan nan na na kisi taami ra naxan goroxi keli koore. Naxan yo na yi taami tan don, a kisima nɛ abadan. Yi taami findixi n fate nan na, n naxan fima sɛrɛxɛ ra alako duniɲa xa kisi sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Na kui, sɔnxɔɛ naxa mini Yuwifie tagi, e nu a fala, «Pe, yi xɛmɛ nɔma a fate sube sode won yi ra di, won xa a don?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, xa wo mu Adama xa Di fate sube don, xa wo mu a wuli min, kisi mu wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Naxan n sube donma, a n wuli min, na kanyi kisima nɛ abadan, n a rakelima nɛ faxɛ ma lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />N fate nan findixi baloe yati ra. N wuli nan findixi minse yati ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Naxan n sube donma, a n wuli min, n bara sabati na kanyi i, a fan bara sabati n fan i. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Baba Ala to n xɛɛxi, kisi fatanma naxan na, kisi na n fan yi a tan saabui ra. Na mɔɔli man na, naxan baloma n tan ma, na kanyi kisima n saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Taami naxan goroxi keli koore, a na be. A mu luxi alɔ wo benbae taami naxan don. E tan faxa nɛ. Naxan yi taami tan donma, na kanyi kisima nɛ abadan.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Isa yi masenyi ti nɛ a nu mixie kawandima tɛmui naxɛ Kapɛrɛnamu salide kui.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa fɔxirabirɛ gbegbe ɲanige masarafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />E to a xa masenyi mɛ, a fɔxirabirɛ wuyaxi naxa a fala, «Yi masenyi tan xɔrɔxɔ de! Nde nɔma tinde a ra?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Isa to a kolon a a fɔxirabirɛe na yi wɔyɛnyi falafe e bore tagi, a naxa e maxɔrin, «N ma masenyi bara wo raxɔnɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Xa a sa li go, wo sa Adama xa Di to te ra koore ma, a kelixi dɛnnaxɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan kisi fima mixi ma. Fate bɛndɛ tan mu nɔma sese ra. N masenyi naxan tixi wo bɛ, a Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nun kisi sɔtɔ ki nan masenma. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kɔnɔ mixi ndee na wo ya ma, naxee mu danxaniyaxi.» Isa na fala nɛ barima kabi a fɔlɛ, a nu a kolon naxee mu danxaniyaxi, a nun naxan fama a yanfade, a a sa kuntigie bɛlɛxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />A man naxa a masen, «Na nan a ra, n a falaxi nɛ wo bɛ, a mixi yo mu nɔma fade n xɔn ma, xa Baba Ala mu na danxaniya fi a ma.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Na xanbi, a fɔxirabirɛ gbegbe naxa ɲanige masara, e gbilen a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Na kui, Isa naxa a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie maxɔrin, «Wo tan go? Wo fan wama kelife n xun ma?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, xa muxu gbilen i fɔxɔ ra, muxu fa sigama nde xɔn ma? Abadan kisi masenyi na i tan nan yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Muxu bara la a ra, muxu man bara gɛ a kolonde, a i tan nan na Ala xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N tan xa mu wo sugandi, wo tan mixi fu nun firinyie? Kɔnɔ mixi keren na wo ya ma, adama sentanɛ nan a ra.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />A nu Simɔn Isikariyoti xa di Yudasi nan ma, naxan nu na a fɔxirabirɛ fu nun firinyie ya ma. A tan nan nu fama a yanfade, a a sa kuntigie bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Isa xunyae xa danxaniyatareɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Na xanbi, Isa naxa Galile bɔxi isa fɔlɔ. A mu nu Yudaya tan iɲɛrɛma, barima Yuwifi kuntigie nu katafe nɛ e xa a faxa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Yuwifie xa Bage Ti Sali to nu bara makɔrɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Isa xunyae naxa a fala a bɛ, «A lan nɛ i xa keli yi bɔxi ma, i siga Yudaya, alako i fɔxirabirɛe naxee sa na naa, e fan xa i xa walie to, i naxee rabama. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mixi mu a xa wali nɔxunma xa a wama duniɲa xa a kolon. I to yi tɔnxumae rabama, a lanma i xa e raba kɛnɛ ma.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />E na fala nɛ, barima hali e to findixi a xunyae ra, e mu nu laxi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «N ma waxati mu nu a li sinden, kɔnɔ waxati yo mu na wo tan xa fe ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Duniɲa mu nɔma wo tan xɔnde, kɔnɔ e n tan xɔnma, barima n seedeɲɔxɔya bama e xa fe ra, a e xa walie kobi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Wo tan xa te Darisalamu, wo sa sali raba naa. N tan mu sigama, barima n ma waxati mu gɛxi a lide sinden.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />A na fala xanbi, a naxa lu Galile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kawandi tife Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />A xunyae to te sali rabade Darisalamu, Isa fan naxa siga, kɔnɔ a gundo ki ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Sali to nu rabafe, Yuwifi kuntigie nu a fenfe Darisalamu, e nu maxɔrinyi ti, «A na minden?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mixie nu wɔyɛn gbegbe makɔyikɔyima e bore tuli Isa xa fe ra. Ndee a falama a mixi fanyi nan a ra, ndee a falama a a na ɲama ratantanfe nan tui. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kɔnɔ e to nu gaaxuxi Yuwifi kuntigie ya ra, mixi yo mu nu suusama a xa fe falade kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Yuwifie nu sali naxan nabafe, lɔxun keren na a ra. Na to nu bara siga han a tagi, Isa naxa te hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a kawandi ti fɔlɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa kaaba, e nu a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ lɔnnixi yi mɔɔli ra di, a to mu xaranxi?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N kawandi naxan tima, a mu kelixi n tan xa ma. A kelixi n Xɛɛma nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mixi naxan wama Ala waxɔnfe rabafe, a nɔma nɛ a kolonde xa yi xaranyi fatanxi Ala nan na. Xa n gbe gbansan na a ra, mixie a kolonma nɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mixi naxan wɔyɛnma a yɛtɛ xaxili ma, a matɔxɔɛ fenfe a yɛtɛ nan bɛ. Kɔnɔ naxan matɔxɔɛ fenfe a Xɛɛma bɛ, nɔndi falɛ nan na kanyi ra, tinxintareya yo mu naxan bɔɲɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Annabi Munsa yati nan Ala xa sɛriyɛ soxi wo yi ra, kɔnɔ wo mu a ratinmɛxi. Munfe ra wo wama n faxafe?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ɲama naxa a fala, «Ɲinnɛ nan na i fɔxɔ ra! Nde katafe i faxade?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N kaabanako keren nan naba, a fa wo birin dɛ ixara. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Munsa a benbae xa sɛriyɛ falaxi nɛ wo bɛ a wo xa wo xa di xɛmɛe sunna. Wo na rabama hali malabu lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Xa xɛmɛ sunnama malabu lɔxɔɛ alako Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ naxa fa kana, wo xɔnɔma n tan ma munfe ra, n to furema fate birin nayalan malabu lɔxɔɛ ma? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Wo xa fee kui mato a fanyi ra beenun wo xa kiiti sa. Kiiti xa tinxin.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Darisalamuka ndee nu a falafe, «Kuntigie mu na katafe yi xa faxade? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />A mato, a tan nan wɔyɛnfe kɛnɛ ma yi ki, kɔnɔ e mu sese falama a bɛ! Ka e bara la a ra, a Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi na a ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kɔnɔ won birin Isa baride kolon. Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi tan na fa, a baride mu kolonma.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Na kui, Isa naxa kawandi ti a xui itexi ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, «Wo n kolon, wo n kelide fan kolon? Kɔnɔ n tan mu faxi n yɛtɛ kan ɲanige xa ma. Nɔndi Kanyi nan n xɛɛxi, kɔnɔ wo tan mu a kolon. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />N tan a kolon, barima n fatanxi a tan nan na. A tan nan n xɛɛxi.»<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Na kui, e naxa kata a suxude, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ, barima a xa waxati mu nu a lixi sinden. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Kɔnɔ ɲama ya ma mixi gbegbe naxa danxaniya Isa ma, e nu a fala, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi na fa, a tɔnxuma makaabaxie rabama dangi yi xɛmɛ ra?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Farisɛnie to a mɛ, ɲama nu naxan makɔyikɔyife Isa xa fe ra, e tan nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kɔsibilie xɛɛ, e xa sa Isa suxu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Isa naxa a masen, «N na wo ya ma sinden dondoronti, n fa siga n Xɛɛma yire. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Wo fama nɛ n fende, kɔnɔ wo mu n toma. N sa luma dɛnnaxɛ, wo mu nɔma naa lide.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa e bore maxɔrin, «Yi wama sigafe minden, won mu sa nɔma a tode dɛnnaxɛ? Ka a waxi nɛ a xa sa sabati ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛ alɔ muxu xa mixi ndee, alako a xa sa si gbɛtɛe xaran? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />A to a masenxi a muxu fama a fende kɔnɔ muxu mu a toma, a a sa luma dɛnnaxɛ, muxu mu nɔma naa lide, a waxi munse falafe?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kisi ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Na sali waxati lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ ma, naxan tide gbo boore birin bɛ, Isa naxa keli, a a masen a xui itexi ra, «Ye xɔli na naxan yo ma, a xa fa n xɔn, a xa a min. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Alɔ Kitaabui a masenxi ki naxɛ, naxan yo na danxaniya n ma, kisi ye bulama nɛ a bɔɲɛ kui, alɔ xure naxan susuma.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />A nu na Ala Xaxili nan ma fe masenfe, a xa danxaniyatɔɛe nu fama naxan sɔtɔde. Na waxati, Ala Xaxili mu nu faxi sinden, barima Isa xa xunnakeli mu nu makɛnɛnxi sinden.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ɲama to a xa masenyi mɛ, ndee naxa a fala, «Muxu nu namiɲɔnmɛ naxan mamɛxi a xa fa, a tan nan yati yi ki!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Gbɛtɛ fan naxa a fala, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na yi ra!» Kɔnɔ ndee fan naxa a fala, «Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi findima Galileka ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Kitaabui mu a masenxi xɛ, a Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi kelima Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ nɛ, a keli Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, Dawuda xɔnyi?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Na kui, ɲama mu nu lanxi Isa xa fe ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Ndee nu wama a suxufe, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu nɔ.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Na kui, kɔsibilie naxa gbilen sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Farisɛnie yire. Na kuntigie naxa e maxɔrin, «Munfe ra wo mu faxi a ra be?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Kɔsibilie naxa e yaabi, «A xa masenyi dangi adamadie xa masenyi birin na.» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farisɛnie fan naxa e yaabi, «Pe, a bara wo fan madaxu? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mixi keren na kuntigie xa na mu Farisɛnie ya ma naxan laxi a ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Yi ɲama tan mu sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kolon. Mixi dankaxie nan e ra.»<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Kɔnɔ Nikodemu, naxan nu bara siga Isa yire, a naxa a fala a boore kuntigie bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Won ma sɛriyɛ ki ma, mixi nɛ makiitima, a mu maxɔrinma xɛ alako a xa kolon sinden a fe naxan nabaxi?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />E naxa a yaabi, «Galileka nan na i fan na? A mato Kitaabui kui, namiɲɔnmɛ yo mu kelima Galile bɔxi!» <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Na xanbi, kankan naxa siga a xɔnyi.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ginɛ yɛnɛla makiitife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Isa naxa siga Oliwi geya ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kuye to iba, a naxa siga hɔrɔmɔbanxi. Ɲama to fa a yire, a naxa dɔxɔ, a so e kawandife.<verse eid="JHN 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe nun Farisɛnie fan naxa fa ginɛ nde ra, e naxan suxuxi a na yɛnɛ rabafe. E naxa a ti mixi birin ya i, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />e a fala Isa bɛ, «Karamɔxɔ, muxu yi ginɛ suxuxi yɛnɛ nan xun. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Sɛriyɛ ki ma, Annabi Munsa muxu yamarixi nɛ muxu xa yi ginɛ mɔɔli magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han a faxa. I tan a toxi di?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />E nu na gantanyi nan tefe a bɛ na maxɔrinyi ra, a xa fe nde fala, e nɔma a kalamude naxan ma. Isa naxa a igoro, a nu fa sɛbɛli ti bɔxi ma a bɛlɛxɛsole ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />E to dɔxɔ a ra, a naxa keli, a a fala e bɛ, «Yunubi mu na naxan ma wo ya ma, na singe xa yi ginɛ gɔnɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />A man naxa a igoro, a nu fa sɛbɛli ti bɔxi ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />E to a xa wɔyɛnyi mɛ, e birin naxa siga keren keren, fɔlɔfe forie ma. Ginɛ gbansan to lu Isa ya i, <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Isa naxa keli, a ginɛ maxɔrin, «Naxee fa i ra, e na minden? Mixi yo mu lu naxan i makiitima?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ginɛ naxa a yaabi, «N marigi, mixi yo mu lu.» Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Awa, n fan mu i makiitima. Siga, i naxa yunubi raba sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nan na duniɲa naiyalanyi ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Isa man naxa wɔyɛnyi tongo, a a masen ɲama bɛ, «N tan nan na duniɲa naiyalanyi ra. Naxan na bira n fɔxɔ ra, a mu ɲɛrɛma dimi kui muku. Kisi naiyalanyi nan yanbama na kanyi bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Na kui, Farisɛnie naxa a fala a bɛ, «I na i yɛtɛ kan nan seede bafe. I xa seedeɲɔxɔya mu findixi nɔndi ra.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Hali n seede ba n yɛtɛ bɛ, n ma seedeɲɔxɔya findixi nɔndi nan na, barima n a kolon n kelixi dɛnnaxɛ, n man a kolon n sigafe dɛnnaxɛ. Kɔnɔ wo tan mu n kelide kolon, wo mu n sigade fan kolon. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Wo tan mixi makiitima adama xaxili nan na. N tan mu mixi yo makiitima. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Kɔnɔ xa n sa mixi makiitima, n ma kiiti findima nɔndi nan na, barima n keren xa mu a ra. N tan nun Baba Ala nan a ra, a tan naxan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />A sɛbɛxi wo xa sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kui, a xa mixi firin xa seedeɲɔxɔya baxi lan e bore ma, na xa suxu nɔndi ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />N tan nan na n yɛtɛ seede ra. Baba Ala fan, a tan naxan n xɛɛxi, a fan seedeɲɔxɔya bama n ma fe ra.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />E naxa Isa maxɔrin, «I baba na minden?» A naxa e yaabi, «Wo mu n kolon, wo mu n Baba fan kolon. Xa wo n kolon nɛ nu, wo n Baba fan kolonma nɛ nu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Isa yi masenyi ti hɔrɔmɔbanxi, hadiya sase yire nɛ, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu a suxu, barima a xa waxati mu nu a lixi sinden.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa findixi Ala xa Xɛɛra nan na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Isa man naxa a masen e bɛ, «N fama nɛ sigade. Wo n fenma nɛ, kɔnɔ wo lɔɛma nɛ wo xa yunubie xa fe ra. N sigama dɛnnaxɛ, wo tan mu nɔma sigade naa.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a fala e bore tagi, «Pe, a to a falama, a a sigama dɛnnaxɛ, won tan mu nɔma sigade naa, a waxi a yɛtɛ nan faxafe ba?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Duniɲa mixie nan na wo ra. Kɔnɔ n tan kelixi koore nɛ. Wo xɔnyi findixi yi duniɲa nan na, kɔnɔ n tan xɔnyi mu a ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />N a falaxi wo bɛ na nan ma, a wo lɔɛma nɛ wo xa yunubie xa fe ra. Xa wo mu la a ra, a n tan nan na naxan na abadan, wo faxama nɛ wo xa yunubie na wo ma.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />E naxa a maxɔrin, «I findixi nde ra?» Isa naxa e yaabi, «Kabi a fɔlɛ, n na falama wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Marakɔrɔsi gbegbe nan n yi ra wo tan mabiri, naxan findima kiiti xɔrɔxɔɛ ra wo bɛ. Nɔndi falɛ nan n Xɛɛma ra. N naxan mɛxi a ra, n na nan falama duniɲa bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />E mu a fahaamu a Isa nu wɔyɛnfe e bɛ Baba Ala nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Na kui, Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo na Adama xa Di rate wuri kɔn na tɛmui naxɛ, wo a kolonma nɛ, a n tan nan na naxan na abadan, n man mu fefe rabama n yɛtɛ ra, n mu fefe falama fo n Baba na naxan masen n bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />N tan nun n Xɛɛma nan a ra. A mu n nabɛɲinxi, barima n a waxɔnfe nan nabama tɛmui birin.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Isa to nu yi fee masenma, mixi gbegbe naxa danxaniya a ma.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iburahima xa die nun Ibulisa xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Na kui, Isa naxa a masen Yuwifie bɛ naxee nu bara danxaniya a ma, «Xa wo lu n xui rabatu ra, wo findixi n fɔxirabirɛe yati nan na. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Wo na nɔndi kolon, a wo xɔrɛyama nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />E naxa a yaabi, «Annabi Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ nan na muxu ra. Han to, muxu tan mu nu findi mixi yo xa konyie ra! Munfe ra i a falaxi a muxu xɔrɛyama nɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, mixi naxan yunubi rabama a bara lu yunubi xa konyiya kui. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mixi xa konyi mu luma fɔxɔɛ ra abadan. Kɔnɔ mixi xa di tan, a xɔnyi nan na fɔxɔɛ ra abadan. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Na kui, xa Ala xa Di wo xɔrɛya, a lima wo xɔrɛya nan yati sɔtɔxi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />«N a kolon tan, a Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ nan na wo ra, kɔnɔ wo katafe n faxade nɛ wo to tondixi n ma masenyi ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />N tan bara naxan to Baba Ala ra, n na nan falama. Wo fan bara naxan mɛ wo baba ra, wo na nan nabama.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />E naxa a yaabi, «Annabi Iburahima nan na muxu baba ra.» Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Xa Iburahima xa die nan yati wo ra nu, wo luma Iburahima fɔxi nan naba ra nu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Kɔnɔ wo tan na katafe n faxade, n tan naxan nɔndi falama wo bɛ n naxan mɛxi Ala ra. Iburahima wali ki mu lanxi na ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Wo na wo baba nan fɔxi rabafe.» E naxa a fala a bɛ, «Yɛnɛ die xa mu na muxu tan na de! Ala keren nan na muxu Baba ra.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Xa Ala nan wo Baba ra nu, wo n xanuma nɛ nu, barima n to na wo ya ma be, n kelixi Ala nan ma. N mu faxi n yɛtɛ xa ra, a tan nan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Munfe ra wo mu n xui fahaamuma? Wo mu nɔxi n ma masenyi ramɛde. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Wo tan baba findixi Ibulisa nan na, a xɔli man wo ma wo xa a tan nan sago raba. Kabi a fɔlɛ, faxɛti nan a ra. A mu tinma nɔndi ra, barima nɔndi yo mu na a xa fe kui. A to wule falama, a a yɛtɛ xui nan yati falafe, barima wule falɛ nan a ra naxan findixi wule birin baba ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kɔnɔ n tan to nɔndi nan falama, wo mu lama n na. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nde nɔma n kalamude yunubi ma? Xa n nɔndi nan falama, munfe ra wo mu laxi n na? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mixi naxan kelixi Ala ma, na Ala xui mɛma. Na kui, wo tan mu a mɛma barima wo mu kelixi Ala ma.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a fala, «Nɔndi na muxu bɛ. Samarika ɲinnɛ kanyi nan i tan na.» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Ɲinnɛ mu n tan fɔxɔ ra. N tan n Baba nan binyama, kɔnɔ wo tan n yelebuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />N mu n yɛtɛ igboma. Ala nan n ma fe itema. Kiiti birin na a tan nan yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, xa naxan yo n xui suxu, na kanyi mu saya kolonma abadan.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yuwifie naxa a fala a bɛ, «Muxu bara gɛ a kolonde fa a ɲinnɛ nan na i fɔxɔ ra. Iburahima nun namiɲɔnmɛe birin laaxira nɛ, kɔnɔ i tan naxɛ, ‹Xa naxan yo n xui suxu, a kanyi mu saya kolonma abadan.› <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Pe, muxu benba Iburahima to fa laaxira nɛ, i tan dangi a ra? Namiɲɔnmɛe fan laaxira nɛ. I tan fa i yɛtɛ findixi nde ra?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Xa n tan nan n yɛtɛ matɔxɔma, matɔxɔɛ fufafu nan na ki. N Baba nan n ma fe itexi, wo naxan ma, a wo Marigi Ala! <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Wo mu a tan Ala kolon, kɔnɔ n tan a kolon. Xa n a fala, a n mu a kolon, n bara findi wule falɛ ra, alɔ wo tan. N tan Ala kolon, n man a xa masenyi rabatuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Wo benba Iburahima sɛɛwa nɛ n fa lɔxɔɛ tofe ra. A a to nɛ yati, a ɲɛlɛxin.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yuwifi kuntigie naxa a yaabi, «Hali ɲɛ tongo suuli, i mu nu a sɔtɔ sinden. Munse a niyaxi i xa a fala a i tan bara Iburahima to?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, beenun Iburahima xa bari, n tan na.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />E naxa gɛmɛe tongo keren na, e xa a magɔnɔ na masenyi xa fe ra, kɔnɔ Isa naxa a nɔxun, a mini hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Isa dɔnxui ya rabɔɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Isa to nu kira xɔn, a naxa dɔnxui nde to naxan barixi dɔnxuya kui. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa a maxɔrin, «Karamɔxɔ, nde xa yunubi a niyaxi yi xɛmɛ xa bari a dɔnxuxi, a tan ka a barimixie?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «A xa yunubi mu a ra, a barimixie fan gbe mu a ra. A rabaxi nɛ alako Ala xa wali xa makɛnɛn a xa fe kui. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Fanni kuye ibaxi, fo won xa n Xɛɛma xa wali raba, barima kɔɛ na fafe. A na so, mixi mu nɔma walide sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />N to na duniɲa ma yi ki, n tan nan na duniɲa naiyalanyi ra.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />A na fala xanbi, Isa naxa dɛye bɔxun bɔxi, a bɛndɛ yogon a ra. A naxa na maso dɔnxui ya ma, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />a fa a fala a bɛ, «Sa i ya raxa Silɔmu ye yire.» Na Silɔmu xili nan falaxi e xa xui, «Xɛɛra». Na kui, dɔnxui naxa sa a ya raxa, a gbilen, a ya se toma.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />A dɔxɔbooree nun naxee nu darixi a to ra kulɛ matide, e naxa a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ xa mu nu dɔxɔma be, a nu kulɛ mati?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ndee naxɛ, «Iyo, a tan nan a ra.» Gbɛtɛe naxɛ, «Ade, e maniyaxi nɛ.» Kɔnɔ a tan xɛmɛ naxa wɔyɛn e bɛ, a a fala, «N tan nan yati a ra!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Na kui, e naxa a maxɔrin, «I ya fa rabɔɔxi di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />A naxa e yaabi, «Xɛmɛ naxan xili falama Isa, na nan bɛndɛ yogon dɛye ra, a a sa n ya ma, a fa a fala n bɛ, ‹Sa i ya raxa Silɔmu ye yire.› Na kui, n to sa n ya raxa, n naxa se to.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />E naxa fa a maxɔrin, «Yi xɛmɛ na minden?» A naxa e yaabi, «N mu a kolon.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />E naxa dɔnxui rayalanxi xanin Farisɛnie yire. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Isa dɛye masunbuxi bɛndɛ ra lɔxɔ naxɛ, a dɔnxui ya rabɔɔ, malabu lɔxɔɛ nan nu a ra. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Na kui, Farisɛnie fan naxa so a maxɔrinfe, a ya rabɔɔxi ki naxɛ. A naxa e yaabi, «A bɛndɛ yogonxi nan sa n ya ma, n e raxa, e se to.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Farisɛni ndee naxa a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ Isa, a mu kelixi Ala xa ma, barima a mu malabu lɔxɔɛ sɛriyɛ rabatuma.» Kɔnɔ gbɛtɛe nu a falama, «Yunubitɔɛ nɔma yi kaabanako mɔɔlie rabade?» Na kui, Farisɛnie mu nu lanxi e bore ma. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />E man naxa dɔnxui rayalanxi maxɔrin, «A to i tan nan ya rabɔɔxi, I tan a xa fe toxi di?» A naxa e yaabi, «Namiɲɔnmɛ nan a ra.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yuwifi kuntigie nu siikɛxi na dɔnxui xa fe ra. E mu nu a kolon xa dɔnxui yati yati nan nu a ra. Na kui, e naxa a barimixie xili, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />e e maxɔrin, «Wo xa di nan ya, wo naxan ma a a dɔnxuxi nan barixi? A ya fa rabɔɔxi di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />A barimixie naxa e yaabi, «Muxu a kolon, a muxu xa di nan a ra. Muxu man a kolon, a a barixi dɔnxuya nan kui. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Kɔnɔ a ya fa rabɔɔxi ki naxɛ, muxu mu na tan kolon. Muxu man mu a kolon mixi yo na rabaxi a bɛ. Wo a tan nan maxɔrin. Dimɛdi xa mu a ra, a yɛtɛ a xa dɛntɛgɛ sama.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />A xa mixie na yaabi ti nɛ, barima e nu gaaxuxi Yuwifi kuntigie ya ra. Nee nu bara lan a ma a mixi yo naxan na a fala Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan a ra, e xa tɔnyi dɔxɔ na kanyi ma a naxa so salide kui. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Na nan a niya a barimixie naxa a fala, «Dimɛdi xa mu a ra, wo a tan nan maxɔrin.»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Na kui, Farisɛnie naxa na dɔnxui rayalanxi xili a firin nde, e a fala a bɛ, «I i kali Ala ra, i nɔndi fala. Muxu tan a kolon a yunubitɔɛ nan na na xɛmɛ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />A naxa e yaabi, «Xa yunubitɔɛ nan a ra, n tan mu a kolon. Kɔnɔ n fe keren tan kolon: N nu dɔnxuxi nɛ, kɔnɔ n ya bara fa se to.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />E man naxa a maxɔrin, «A munse raba i ra? A i ya rabɔɔxi di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />A naxa e yaabi, «N ɲan bara na fala wo bɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu tin n xui ramɛde. Wo man fa wama n xa gbilen a ma munfe ra? Ka wo fan waxi findife a fɔxirabirɛe nan na?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />E naxa a konbi, e a fala a bɛ, «I tan nan findixi a fɔxirabirɛ ra! Annabi Munsa fɔxirabirɛe nan na muxu tan na! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Muxu a kolon tan, a Ala wɔyɛn nɛ Annabi Munsa bɛ, kɔnɔ yi xɛmɛ Isa tan, muxu mu a kelide kolon.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Xɛmɛ naxa e yaabi, «Fe makaabaxi nan ya! A bara n ya rabɔɔ, kɔnɔ wo tan mu a kelide kolon! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Won a kolon tan, a Ala mu yunubitɔɛ xa duba tongoma. Naxan gaaxuma a ya ra, a a sago raba, a na nan xa maxandi suxuma. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Duniɲa birin a kolon mixi mu nɔma dɔnxui ya rabɔɔde naxan barixi dɔnxuya kui. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Xa yi xɛmɛ mu kelixi Ala xa ma nu, a mu nɔma fefe rabade.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />E naxa a yaabi, «I tan naxan barixi yunubi kui, i waxi findife muxu karamɔxɔ ra?» E naxa fa a keri salide.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Isa to a mɛ, a e bara a keri salide, a naxa sa a fen, a a maxɔrin, «I danxaniyaxi Adama xa Di ma?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />A naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, a fala n bɛ mixi naxan a ra, alako n xa danxaniya a ma.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «I ɲan bara a to. A tan nan man wɔyɛnfe i bɛ yi ki.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />A naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Marigi, n bara danxaniya.» A fa a suyidi a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Isa naxa a masen, «N faxi yi duniɲa ma mixie makiitife nan ma, alako dɔnxui xa se to, ya kanyi xa dɔnxu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Farisɛni naxee nu na naa, e naxa a xui mɛ, e a maxɔrin, «Pe, dɔnxui nan na muxu fan na?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Xa dɔnxui nan na wo ra nu, yunubi mu luma wo ma. Kɔnɔ wo to a falama, a wo ya fan, wo xa yunubi bara lu wo ma.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Xuruse dɛmadonyi xa taalie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />«N xa nɔndi fala wo bɛ, muɲɛti nun suute mu soma gɔɔrɛ naadɛ ra. E tuganma nɛ sansanyi xun ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Naxan soma gɔɔrɛ naadɛ ra, na nan findixi xuruse dɛmadonyi ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Naadɛ kantama nan naadɛ rabima a bɛ. A na wɔyɛn xurusee ra, e birin bira a fɔxɔ ra. A kankan xili a xili ra, e birin mini tande. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />A na a gbe birin namini, a sa tima e ya ra nɛ, e fan bira a fɔxɔ ra, barima e a xui kolon. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Xa mixi gbɛtɛ na a ra e mu naxan kolon, e mu birama a fɔxɔ ra muku. E e gima nɛ na tan ya ra, barima e mu a xui kolon.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Isa naxa na taali wɔyɛnyi fala e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu a xa masenyi fahaamu.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Na kui, Isa man naxa a masen, «N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, n tan nan na yɛxɛɛe xa naadɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Naxee singe fa n bɛ, muɲɛtie nun suutee nan na e birin na. Yɛxɛɛe mu e tan xui ramɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />N tan nan na gɔɔrɛ naadɛ ra. Naxan yo na so n saabui ra, a kanyi kisima nɛ, a nu so, a nu mini, a nu baloe sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Muɲɛti tan mu fama fefe ma bafe muɲɛ tide, faxɛ tide, nun kasarɛ sade. N tan faxi nɛ, alako mixie xa kisi sɔtɔ, e xa duniɲɛigiri xa fan a fanyi ra.»<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />«N misaalixi xuruse kantama fanyi nan na, naxan mu tondima faxade a xa xuruse kantɛ kui. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Walikɛ nan a gima wula bare ya ra, barima xurusee mu findixi a gbe ra, a bɔɲɛ mu na e kantafe ra. A xurusee rabɛɲinma nɛ, wula bare ndee faxa, a ndee rayensen yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Walikɛ mu a ɲɛngi sama xurusee xa fe xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />N tan misaalixi xuruse kantɛ fanyi nan na. Xurusee kantɛ nun a xa xurusee, e e bore kolon, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />alɔ n tan nun Baba Ala muxu muxu bore kolonxi ki naxɛ. N fan bara tin faxade n ma xurusee bɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />«Yɛxɛɛ gbɛtɛe fan na n bɛ naxee mu na yi gɔɔrɛ kui. Fo n xa fa nɛ nee fan na. E fan n xui ramɛma nɛ, yɛxɛɛe birin findi gɔɔrɛ keren na, xuruse dɛmadonyi keren bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Na nan a toxi Baba Ala n xanuxi, barima n nan n nii fima, alako n man xa a rasuxu. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Mixi xa mu n tan nii bama de, n tan yɛtɛ yati a fima. Nɔɛ na n bɛ, n xa n nii fi. Nɔɛ man na n bɛ, n xa gbilen a rasuxu ra. N Baba n yamarixi na nan na.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Yuwifie man mu nu lanxi e bore ma na masenyi xa fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Mixi gbegbe nu a falafe nɛ, «Ɲinnɛ nan na yi fɔxɔ ra. A bara daxu. Wo wo tuli matima a ra munfe ra?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Kɔnɔ booree nu e yaabima, «Ɲinnɛ na mixi naxan fɔxɔ ra, a mu wɔyɛnma yi mɔɔli ra de! Ka ɲinnɛ nɔma dɔnxui ya rabɔɔde?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuwifie xa danxaniyatareɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Xinbeli tɛmui to nu a ra, Darisalamukae nu na Hɔrɔmɔbanxi Rabi Sali nan nabafe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Isa nu ɲɛrɛfe hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire nde, dɛnnaxɛ xili «Mangɛ Sulemani xa buntunyi.» <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yuwifie naxa Isa rabilin mɛnni, e a fala a bɛ, «I siikɛ bama muxu ma mun tɛmui? Xa i tan nan findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, a fala muxu bɛ a fiixɛ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N ɲan bara a fala wo bɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu laxi n na. N fe naxee rabama n Baba xili ra, nee nan findixi seedeɲɔxɔya ra n ma fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Kɔnɔ wo mu danxaniyaxi, barima n ma yɛxɛɛe xa mu wo ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />N gbe yɛxɛɛe tan n xui mɛma, n e kolon, e birama n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />N tan abadan kisi nan fima e ma. E mu lɔɛma abadan, sese man mu e bama n yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />N Baba, a tan naxan e so n yi ra, a dangi birin na. Sese mu nɔma e bade a tan Baba Ala yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />N tan nun Baba Ala, muxu birin keren.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yuwifie man naxa gɛmɛe tongo, e xa Isa magɔnɔ a faxa xili ma, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />kɔnɔ a naxa a fala e bɛ, «N bara wali fanyi gbegbe raba wo ya xɔri, naxee fatanxi Baba Ala ma. Wo a fala n bɛ ba, wo fa waxi n faxafe n ma wali fanyi mundun ma?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />E naxa a yaabi, «Muxu mu i magɔnɔfe xɛ i xa wali fanyi nde xa ma. Muxu i magɔnɔma i to Ala rasɔtɔfe. I tan ibunadama waxi i yɛtɛ findife Ala ra!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «A mu sɛbɛxi xɛ wo xa sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kui, a Ala a masen nɛ, ‹N tan Ala bara a fala, alae nan wo ra›? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Kitaabui xui tan mu kanama. A xa masenyi faxi naxee ma, Ala bara e xili fala, ‹alae›. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />N bara a fala Ala xa Di nan n na, kɔnɔ a mu lanma wo xa a fala n bara Ala rasɔtɔ, barima Baba Ala n tan nan sugandixi, a n xɛɛ duniɲa ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Xa n mu n Baba xa walie xa rabama, wo naxa la n na. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Kɔnɔ xa n a raba, wo xa la na wali ra, hali wo mu la n tan na. Wo xa la n ma wali ra, alako wo xa a kolon a Baba Ala na n i, n fan na Baba Ala i.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Isa to na fala, mixie man naxa kata a suxude, kɔnɔ a naxa mini e bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Isa naxa gbilen Yurudɛn naakiri ma, a lu mɛnni, Yaya mixie xunxa ye xɔɔra fɔlɔ dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Mixi gbegbe naxa siga a yire, e nu a fala e bore bɛ, «Annabi Yaya tan mu tɔnxuma makaabaxi yo raba, kɔnɔ a naxan birin masen yi xɛmɛ xa fe ra, a birin findixi nɔndi nan na.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Mɛnnika gbegbe naxa danxaniya Isa ma.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lasaru rakelife faxɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Xɛmɛ nde nu furaxi Betani naxan xili Lasaru. A maaginɛe fan nu sabatixi naa, Mariyama nun Marata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariyama nan labundɛ ture sa Marigi sanyie ma, a fa e mafuruku a xunsɛxɛ ra. A tan nan maaxɛmɛ findi Lasaru ra, naxan nu furaxi. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Na kui, Lasaru maaginɛe naxa xɛɛra xɛɛ Isa ma, a xa sa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, i xanuntenyi furaxi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Isa to a mɛ, a naxa a masen, «Yi fure mu sa raɲɔnma faxɛ xa ma, a fama Ala xa nɔrɛ nan makɛnɛnde, alako Ala xa Di fan xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ a saabui ra.»<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Isa nu Marata nun Mariyama nun e maaxɛmɛ Lasaru xanuxi ki fanyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />A to Lasaru furafe mɛ, a mu siga dɛdɛ, a naxa lu naa xi firin man. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Na xanbi, a naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Won xa gbilen Yudaya bɔxi ma.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa a fala, «Karamɔxɔ, Yuwifie kataxi i faxade dɛnnaxɛ ya, i tan gbilenfe mɛnni nɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Waxati fu nun firin xa mu na fɛɛɲɛn keren kui? Xa naxan yo a ɲɛrɛma yanyi ra, a mu a sanyi radinma barima yi duniɲa naiyalanyi yanbama a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kɔnɔ xa naxan yo a ɲɛrɛma kɔɛ ra, a a sanyi radinma nɛ, barima naiyalanyi yo mu a bɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />A na fala xanbi, Isa man naxa a masen, «Won xanuntenyi Lasaru bara xi, kɔnɔ n sigafe a raxunude.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, xa a na xife, a yalanma nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Isa to Lasaru xife fala, a nu a faxafe nan ma, kɔnɔ a fɔxirabirɛe tan ɲɔxɔ a ma, a a nu malabui xi xɔli nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Na kui, Isa naxa wɔyɛn e bɛ a fiixɛ ra, «Lasaru bara laaxira <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />kɔnɔ na rabafe n xanbi, a bara findi sɛɛwɛ ra n bɛ, barima a xɔli n ma wo xa danxaniya sɔtɔ yi fe kui. Yakɔsi, won xa siga a yire.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Na tɛmui Tomasi, a nu falama naxan bɛ «Guli», a naxa a fala Isa fɔxirabirɛ booree bɛ, «Won birin xɛɛ, won nun karamɔxɔ birin xa faxa!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Isa to so naa, a naxa a li Lasaru fure bara xi naani raba gaburi kui. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kilo saxan ɲɔndɔn nan nu na Betani nun Darisalamu tagi. E to makɔrɛ, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yuwifi gbegbe nu bara fa Marata nun Mariyama xɔnyi, e maaxɛmɛ ɲɔnfe kunfa bade. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marata to Isa fafe mɛ, a naxa sa a ralan, kɔnɔ Mariyama tan dɔxɔxi naxa lu banxi. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marata naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Marigi, xa i nu na be nu, n maaxɛmɛ mu faxama nu. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Kɔnɔ hali yakɔsi, n a kolon a i na fefe maxɔrin Ala ma, a a rabama nɛ i bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «I xunya kelima nɛ faxɛ ma.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marata naxa a yaabi, «N a kolon tan, a kelima nɛ faxɛ ma duniɲa raɲɔnyi, faxamixie kelima tɛmui naxɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «N tan nan na marakeli nun kisi ra. Naxan na danxaniya n ma, a kisima nɛ, hali a faxa. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Naxan yo baloxi, a danxaniyaxi n ma, na kanyi mu lɔɛma abadan. I laxi na ra?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, Marigi! N laxi a ra a i tan nan na Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, Ala xa Di, naxan lan a xa fa duniɲa ma.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marata na fala xanbi, a naxa siga a xunya Mariyama fɔxɔ ra, a a fala a bɛ e doro ma, «Karamɔxɔ bara fa, a na i xilife.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mariyama to a mɛ, a naxa keli keren na, a siga Isa ralande. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Na tɛmui, Isa mu nu soxi taa kui. Marata a li dɛnnaxɛ, a nu na mɛnni nɛ sinden. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Yuwifi naxee faxi kunfa bade, naxee nu na Mariyama fɛ ma banxi kui, e to a to keli ra mafuren na, e naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra tande. E ɲɔxɔ a ma a a na sigafe gaburi yire nɛ, a xa sa wa naa.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariyama to Isa yire li, a fɛfɛ a to, a naxa suyidi a bɛ, a a fala, «Marigi, xa i nu na be nu, n maaxɛmɛ mu faxama nu!» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Isa to Mariyama to, a na wafe, Yuwifi naxee nu na a fɔxɔ ra, nee fan wafe, a naxa sunnun, a bɔɲɛ naxa raɲaaxu a ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />A naxa maxɔrinyi ti, «Wo a ragataxi minden?» E naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, fa, muxu xa na masen i bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Isa naxa wa. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Na kui, Yuwifie naxa a fala, «A mato, Lasaru nu rafanxi a ma ki naxɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Kɔnɔ ndee e ya ma, e naxa a fala, «Pe, yi naxan dɔnxui ya rabɔɔ, a mu nu nɔma Lasaru ratangade faxɛ ma xɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Isa bɔɲɛ man naxa raɲaaxu a ma. A naxa siga gaburi yire. Fɔnmɛ nde nan nu a ra, gɛmɛ belebele dɔxɔxi na dɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Isa naxa a fala, «Wo gɛmɛ ba naa.» Marata, faxamixi maaginɛ, a naxa a fala, «Marigi, a xa maragatɛ xi naani nan to! A a lima a fure xiri bara mini yi waxati ma.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N mu a fala xɛ i bɛ, a xa i danxaniya, i Ala sɛnbɛ makaabaxi toma nɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Na kui, e naxa gɛmɛ ba fɔnmɛ gaburi dɛ ma. Isa naxa a ya rate koore, a a fala, «N Baba Ala, n bara i tantu i to n xui ramɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />N tan ɲan a kolon, i n xui ramɛma tɛmui birin, kɔnɔ n na falaxi ɲama nan ma fe ra naxee tixi be, e xa la a ra a i tan nan n xɛɛxi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />A na fala xanbi, Isa naxa a xui ite sɛnbɛ ra, a a fala, «Lasaru, mini!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />A tan faxamixi naxa mini a sanyie nun a bɛlɛxɛe maxirixi kasange kui, a yatagi man makunfukunfuxi dugi gbɛtɛ fan na. Isa naxa a fala mixie bɛ, «Wo kasange ba a ma, wo a mafulun, a xa nɔ a ɲɛrɛde.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuwifi kuntigie natɛ tongofe Isa faxafe ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matiyu 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maraki 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luki 22:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Yuwifi naxee nu bara fa Mariyama yire, e Isa xa kaabanako to, e gbegbe naxa danxaniya a ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Kɔnɔ ndee naxa sa dɛntɛgɛ sa Farisɛnie bɛ, Isa fe naxan nabaxi. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Na kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Farisɛnie naxa Yuwifie xa kiitisa xungbee malan. E naxa a fala, «Won munse rabama? Yi xɛmɛ na kaabanako gbegbe nan nabafe. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Xa won a lu a yɛtɛ yi, birin danxaniyama nɛ a ma, Rɔmakae fan fama won ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kanade, e won si sɔntɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />E xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Kayafa, naxan nu na e xunyi ra na waxati, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo tan mu sese kolon yi fe kui. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ka wo mu a fahaamuxi a mixi keren faxafe ɲama bɛ, na nan fan wo bɛ, dinɛ won si birin xa sɔntɔ?»<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayafa xa na wɔyɛnyi mu fatan a tan yɛtɛ xa ra. A to nu findixi na waxati sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xunyi ra, Ala nan na masenyi fi a ma, a Isa nu fafe faxade Isirayila ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Kɔnɔ na man mu raba Isirayilakae gbansan xa bɛ. Isa nu fafe faxade nɛ alako Ala xa a xa die fan malan, naxee rayensenxi yire birin, a xa e birin findi ɲama keren na.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Na kui, kabi na malanyi lɔxɔɛ, Yuwifi kuntigie naxa natɛ tongo Isa faxafe ra. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Na nan a ra Isa mu nɔ minide kɛnɛ ma sɔnɔn. A tan nun a fɔxirabirɛe naxa keli naa, e siga Efirami taa kui gbengberenyi fɛ ma.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Yuwifie xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali to nu bara makɔrɛ, mixi gbegbe naxa keli daaxae tefe ra Darisalamu, e xa e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn beenun sali xa a li. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />E nu na Isa fenfe. E naxa e bore maxɔrin hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui, «Wo xa maɲɔxunyi ma, Isa fama salide, ka a mu fama?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Farisɛnie nu bara yaamari fi, a mixi yo naxan na Isa to, na kanyi xa a fala e bɛ alako e xa a suxu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Mariyama labundɛ ture masofe Isa sanyi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Xi senni beenun Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa a li, Isa naxa siga Betani, Lasaru xɔnyi, a nu bara naxan nakeli faxɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />E naxa donse fanyi yailan, e fa ɲama xili, e xa e dɛge yire keren Isa xa binyɛ bun ma. Marata nu donse itaxunma mixie ma, Lasaru nun Isa naxa lu teebili ra.<verse eid="JHN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariyama naxa sa narada labundɛ ture litiri tagi tongo. Narada tinsexi nan nu a ra, naxan sare xɔrɔxɔ ki fanyi. A naxa a maso Isa sanyie ma, a e mafuruku a xunsɛxɛ ra. Labundɛ ture xiri naxa din banxi birin na. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yudasi Isikariyoti, Isa fɔxirabirɛ naxan nu fama a yanfade, a naxa a fala, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«A nu lanma yi labundɛ xa mati kɔbiri kole kɛmɛ saxan na, a fi setaree ma.» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />A yi fala nɛ barima a tan nan nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe xa kɔbiri ragatama, a nu fa nde muɲa. Setaree xa fe mu nu na a bɔɲɛ kui feo! <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Na kui, Isa naxa a fala, «Gbilen Mariyama fɔxɔ ra. Yi nu ragataxi a yi ra nɛ, n ma maragatɛ nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Setaree luma nɛ wo ya ma tɛmui birin, kɔnɔ n tan mu luma wo ya ma abadan xɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />E to a mɛ a Isa bara fa Betani, Yuwifie ɲama gbegbe fan naxa siga. E mu siga Isa xa fe gbansan xa ma. E nu wama Lasaru fan tofe, Isa naxan nakeli faxɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Na kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa natɛ tongo e xa Lasaru fan faxa, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />barima Yuwifi gbegbe nu gbilenfe e fɔxɔ ra a tan nan ma fe ra, e nu fa danxaniya Isa ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sofe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Na kuye iba, ɲama gbegbe naxan nu faxi Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali rabade, e naxa a mɛ a Isa na fafe Darisalamu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />E naxa tugi fɛnsɛe tongo, e siga a ralande e xui ite ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">«Tantui na won Nakisima bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Baraka na a bɛ naxan fafe Marigi xili ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Isirayila mangɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Isa naxa sofale lanma nde sɔtɔ, a dɔxɔ a fari, alɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui ki naxɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Siyonikae, wo naxa gaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Wo xa mangɛ na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">a dɔxɔxi sofale fari.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Na waxati Isa fɔxirabirɛe mu fahaamui sɔtɔ na fe ma, kɔnɔ Isa to keli faxɛ ma, e naxa ratu Kitaabui sɛbɛli ma naxan nu bara kamali na fe kui.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Ɲama naxan Lasaru to keli ra faxɛ ma, e naxa seede ba Isa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Na nan a niya, ɲama naxa siga a ralande, barima e nu bara na tɔnxuma makaabaxi xa fe mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Na kui, Farisɛnie naxa a fala e bore bɛ, «Wo bara a to, won mu nɔma sese ra. Duniɲa birin bara bira a fɔxɔ ra!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a xa faxɛ xa fe masenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Girɛki mixi ndee fan nu bara te sali rabade Darisalamu, e xa sa Ala batu. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />E naxa fa Filipu xɔn, naxan keli Betesayida, Galile bɔxi ma, e a fala a bɛ, «N ba, muxu wama Isa tofe.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipu naxa sa a fala Andire bɛ, e firin birin naxa siga e sa a fala Isa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Waxati bara a li Adama xa Di xa xunnakeli xa makɛnɛn. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, xa maale xɔri mu si, a mu diɲɛ a yɛtɛ ma bɔxi bun, a luma na ki, a keren gbansan. Kɔnɔ xa a sa diɲɛ a yɛtɛ ma bɔxi bun, a a bogi gbegbe nan naminima. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Naxan gbakuma a yɛtɛ xa duniɲa fe ra, a lɔɛma nɛ. Naxan mu kankanma a yɛtɛ xa fe ma yi duniɲɛigiri kui, a abadan kisi nan sɔtɔma. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Xa naxan yo wama n ma wali suxufe, a xa bira n fɔxɔ ra nɛ, n tan na lu dɛdɛ, n ma walikɛ fan na naa. Xa naxan yo n ma wali suxu, Baba Ala a kanyi binyama nɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«N bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔxi nɛ yi ki, kɔnɔ n fa munse falama? N xa a fala Baba Ala bɛ a xa n natanga yi ɲaxankatɛ waxati ma? Ade, yi ɲaxankatɛ naxan fafe n lide, n faxi na nan yati ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />N Baba Ala, a niya i xili xa ite.» Isa to na fala, xui nde naxa keli koore ma, a a fala, «N bara a ite, n man gbilenma nɛ a ite ra.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ɲama naxee nu tixi naa, e to a mɛ, ndee naxa a fala a galanyi nan xui a ra, kɔnɔ gbɛtɛ naxa a fala, «Malekɛ nan wɔyɛnxi a bɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Isa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Na xui mu minixi n tan n ma fe xa ma, a minixi wo tan nan ma fe ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Yi duniɲa makiiti waxati bara a li. Mangɛya fafe bade yi duniɲa nɔla yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Mixie na n nate wuri magalanbuxi kɔn na n faxafe ra, n mixi birin nafama nɛ n ma.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Isa a faxa ki masen na ki nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Na kui, ɲama naxa a fala Isa bɛ, «Muxu tan bara a mɛ sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kui, a Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi buma abadan. Munfe ra i tan a falama a fo Adama xa Di xa rate? Nde findixi yi Adama xa Di ra?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Ala xa naiyalanyi man luma nɛ wo ya ma dondoronti. Wo xa ɲɛrɛ na naiyalanyi kui, alako dimi naxa wo tɛrɛnna. Naxan ɲɛrɛma dimi kui a mu a sigade toma. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Naiyalanyi to yanbama wo bɛ yi ki, wo xa la a ra nɛ, alako wo xa findi naiyalanyi xa die nan na.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Ɲama danxaniyatare</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Isa to gɛ na falade, a naxa siga, a sa a nɔxun e ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />A nu bara tɔnxuma makaabaxi gbegbe raba e ya xɔri, kɔnɔ na birin kui, e mu danxaniya a ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Na raba nɛ alako Annabi Esayi xui xa kamali, a to a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">«Marigi, nde laxi masenyi ra, e bara naxan mɛ muxu ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Ala sɛnbɛ bara makɛnɛn nde bɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Na kui, e mu nɔ danxaniyade Isa ma, barima Esayi a masen nɛ,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ala bara e ya dɔnxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">a e xaxili balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">alako e ya naxa fa se igbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">e xaxili naxa fa fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">e naxa fa e bɔɲɛ rafindi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">n xa e rayalan.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Annabi Esayi na fala nɛ a to nu bara Isa xa nɔrɛ to. Na kui, a nu Isa xa fe nan falafe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kɔnɔ na birin kui, hali kuntigie ya ma, e gbegbe naxa la Isa ra. Kɔnɔ e mu nu suusama a falade kɛnɛ ma barima e nu gaaxuxi Farisɛnie ya ra, nee naxa fa tɔnyi dɔxɔ e ma, sofe ra salide kui. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Adamadie xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔfe nan nu rafan e ma dangi Ala xa matɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ ɲama bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Isa naxa a xui ite, a a fala, «Naxan na danxaniya n ma, a mu danxaniyaxi n tan xa ma, a danxaniyaxi n Xɛɛma nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Naxan na n tan to, a bara n Xɛɛma to. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />N to faxi duniɲa, naiyalanyi nan n na, alako naxan yo na danxaniya n ma, na kanyi naxa lu dimi kui sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Xa naxan yo n xui mɛ, kɔnɔ a mu a rabatu, n tan mu na kanyi makiitima, barima n mu faxi duniɲa makiitide xɛ. N faxi duniɲa rakiside nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Naxan na tondi n na, a mu tin n ma masenyi ra, na kanyi makiitima na na. N masenyi naxan tima, na nan findima a makiitima ra lɔxɔ dɔnxɔɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Barima n ma masenyi mu fatanxi n tan xa ra. A fatanxi Baba Ala nan na, naxan n xɛɛxi yaamari ra, a lanma n xa naxan fala, n xa naxan masen. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />N a kolon a xa sɛriyɛ findima kisi nan na, naxan mu ɲɔnma abadan. Na nan a ra, n fe masenma wo bɛ alɔ Baba Ala a masenxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Isa a fɔxirabirɛe sanyi maxafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Beenun Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa a li, Isa naxa a kolon a gbe mu nu luxi a xa keli duniɲa ma gbilenfe ra Baba Ala ma. A fɔxirabirɛe a naxee sɔtɔ duniɲa ma, nee nu rafan a ma. Han a faxa tɛmui naxɛ, e xa xanunteya nu na a bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Nunmare, e birin nu e dɛgefe. Ibulisa ɲan nu bara so Simɔn Isikariyoti xa di Yudasi xaxili kui, a xa Isa yanfa. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Isa to nu a kolon a Baba Ala bara fe birin sa a sagoe, a man to a kolon a a kelixi Ala nan ma, a man gbilenfe a tan nan ma, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />a naxa keli e dɛgede, a a xa donma fari igoroe ba a ma, a fa dugi nde xiri a tagi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />A naxa ye sa paani kui, a fa so a fɔxirabirɛe sanyie maxafe, a nu e mafuruku na dugi ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />A to Simɔn Piyɛri li, na naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, i waxi nɛ i xa n tan sanyie maxa?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «N naxan nabafe yi ki, i mu a fahaamuma yi waxati tan ma, kɔnɔ i fama nɛ a kui kolonde yare.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ade, i tan mu n sanyi maxama feo!» Isa naxa a yaabi, «Xa n mu i sanyie maxa, won mu luma fe keren sɔnɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi, xa a na na ki nɛ, i naxa n sanyi gbansan xa maxa. I xa n bɛlɛxɛe nun n xunyi birin maxa.» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Mixi naxan bara a maxa, a hayi mu na a fate maxafe ma bafe a sanyi ra. A ɲan bara sɛniyɛn feo! Wo sɛniyɛnxi, kɔnɔ wo birin mu a ra.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />A a fala nɛ a e birin mu sɛniyɛnxi, barima a a fɔxirabirɛ kolon naxan fama a yanfade.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Isa to gɛ e sanyie maxade, a man naxa a xa donma fari igoroe ragoro a ma, a man a magoro e dɛgede, a a fala e bɛ, «N naxan nabaxi wo bɛ yi ki, wo a fahaamuxi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Wo to a falama n bɛ ‹Karamɔxɔ›, xa na mu a ra ‹Marigi›, wo nɔndi nan a ra, barima na nan yati n na. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Na kui, n tan naxan findixi wo Marigi nun wo Karamɔxɔ ra, xa n tan bara wo sanyie maxa, wo fan lan nɛ wo xa wo bore sanyie maxa. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />N naxan nabaxi wo bɛ, a xa findi misaali nan na, alako wo fan xa na mɔɔli nan naba wo bore tagi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, konyi mu dangi a marigi ra, xɛɛra fan mu dangi a xɛɛma ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Wo to bara fahaamui sɔtɔ yi fee ma, hɛɛri na wo bɛ xa wo e raba.»<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«N mu wo birin xa ma. N tan naxan wo sugandixi, n wo kolon. Kɔnɔ naxan na Kitaabui kui, fo a xa kamali nɛ, a to sɛbɛxi, ‹Muxu nun naxan bɛlɛxɛ na lenge keren kui, na bara a kobe so n na.› <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />N na fe falaxi nɛ wo bɛ beenun a xa raba, alako a raba tɛmui wo xa a kolon a n tan nan na naxan na abadan. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, naxan yo na n ma xɛɛra rasɛnɛ, a n tan nan nasɛnɛxi. Naxan yo na n fan nasɛnɛ, na kanyi n Xɛɛma nan nasɛnɛxi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi xa yanfanteya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matiyu 26:20-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maraki 14:17-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luki 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />A na fala xanbi, Isa bɔɲɛ naxa sunnun, a fa a fala, «N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, mixi keren na wo ya ma, a n yanfama nɛ, a n sa kuntigie bɛlɛxɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e bore mato, e mu a kolon Isa nu mixi yo xa fe falafe. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ, a naxan xanuxi, a nu na a fɛ ma teebili ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Na kui, Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a bɛlɛxɛ magira na bɛ, a xa Isa maxɔrin a kanyi ma, Isa nu baxi naxan ma fe falade. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Na fɔxirabirɛ naxa a maso Isa ra, a a maxɔrin, «Marigi, nde a ra?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «N nu taami ragoro bɔrɛ xɔɔra, n a so mixi naxan yi ra, a tan nan na ki.» Isa to gɛ na falade, a naxa taami rasin bɔrɛ xɔɔra, a a so Simɔn Isikariyoti xa di Yudasi yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yudasi to na taami rasuxu, Sentanɛ naxa a bɔɲɛ masara keren na. Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «I wama naxan nabafe, a raba mafuren mafuren.» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Naxee nu magoroxi e dɛgede, e sese mu a kolon Isa na falafe a bɛ fe naxan ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yudasi to findi e xa kɔbiri ragatɛ ra, ndee naxa a maɲɔxun a Isa nu a xɛɛfe sare nde sode sali xa fe ra, xa na mu a ra a xa sa misikiinɛe ki. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yudasi to na taami xuntunyi rasuxu, a naxa mini keren na. Kɔɛ nu bara so.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaamari nɛɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yudasi to mini, Isa naxa a masen, «Waxati bara a li fa, Adama xa Di xa xunnakeli xa makɛnɛn, Ala fan xa nɔrɛ xa makɛnɛn a saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ala xa nɔrɛ to makɛnɛnma a saabui ra, Ala yɛtɛ fan Adama xa Di xa xunnakeli makɛnɛnma nɛ. A fafe na nan nabade yakɔsi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />N ma die, a gbe mu luxi n xa keli wo xun ma. Wo n fenma nɛ, kɔnɔ n naxan fala Yuwifi kuntigie bɛ, n fa na nan falama wo fan bɛ, ‹N sigama dɛnnaxɛ, wo tan mu nɔma sigade naa.›»<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />«N xa yaamari nɛɛnɛ fi wo ma: Wo xa wo bore xanu nɛ. N tan wo xanuxi ki naxɛ, wo fan xa wo bore xanu na ki. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Duniɲa birin wo kolonma n fɔxirabirɛe ra na fe nan ma, xa wo wo bore xanu.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa a falafe Piyɛri bɛ a a yɛtɛ rasanma nɛ a ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matiyu 26:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maraki 14:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luki 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a maxɔrin, «Marigi, i sigama minden?» Isa naxa a yaabi, «N sigafe dɛnnaxɛ, i mu nɔma birade n fɔxɔ ra sinden, kɔnɔ i fan fama birade n fɔxɔ ra han naa.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Simɔn Piyɛri man naxa a maxɔrin, «Marigi, munfe ra n mu nɔma birade i fɔxɔ ra yakɔsi? N tinxi n xa faxa i xa fe ra!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tinxi i xa faxa n ma fe ra? N xa nɔndi yati nan fala i bɛ, beenun konkore xa a rate, i i yɛtɛ rasanma nɛ n ma sanmaya saxan.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Isa nan na kira, nɔndi, nun kisi ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Isa naxa a fala a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Wo naxa kɔntɔfili. Wo wo xaxili ti Ala ra, wo xa wo xaxili ti n fan na. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Lingira gbegbe nan na n Baba xɔnyi, xa na mu a ra n mu a falama wo bɛ nu, a n sigafe yigiya yailande wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Xa n siga, n naxa sa na yailan wo bɛ, n man fama nɛ wo fɔxɔ ra, alako won birin xa sa lu yire keren. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />N sigafe dɛnnaxɛ, wo na kira kolon.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, muxu mu i sigade kolon. Muxu fa na kira kolonma di?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «N tan nan na kira ra, nɔndi ra, nun kisi ra. Mixi yo mu soma Baba Ala xɔnyi xa n tan saabui xa mu a ra. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Xa wo bara n tan kolon, wo n Baba fan kolonma nɛ. Keli yi waxati ma, wo bara a kolon, wo man bara a to.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipu naxa a fala a bɛ, «Marigi, Baba Ala masen muxu bɛ. A lima na bara muxu wasa.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Filipu, n bara bu wo tagi ki fanyi, kɔnɔ han ya i mu n kolon? Naxan na n tan to, a bara Baba Ala to. I tan fa a falama di, a n xa Baba Ala masen wo bɛ? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />I mu laxi a ra a Baba Ala nun n tan nan a ra, n fan nun Baba Ala nan a ra? N tan masenyi naxee tima wo bɛ, e mu fatan n tan yɛtɛ xa ra. E fatanma Baba Ala nan na. N tan nun Baba Ala naxan a ra tɛmui birin, a tan nan yɛtɛ na a xa wali rabafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Wo xa la n na, a Baba Ala nun n tan nan a ra, n fan nun Baba Ala nan a ra. Xa wo siikɛxi na ma, wo xa la a ra n ma walie tan xa fe ra.»<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />«N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, n tan wali naxee rabama, xa naxan danxaniya n ma, na kanyi fan na wali mɔɔlie rabama nɛ. A ɲan a rabama nɛ naxee dangi n tan gbe ra, barima n tan sigafe Baba Ala nan yire. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Wo naxan birin maxandima n xili ra, n a rabama nɛ wo bɛ alako Baba Ala xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ a xa Di saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Xa wo n maxandi fefe naxan ma n xili ra, n a rabama nɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Xa wo n xanu, wo n ma yaamarie rabatuma nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />N tan fan, n Baba Ala maxandima nɛ a xa Saabui Fanyi gbɛtɛ xɛɛ wo ma, naxan luma wo fɛ ma abadan. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Na nan findixi Ala Xaxili ra, naxan nɔndi makɛnɛnma. Duniɲa tan mu nɔma a sɔtɔde, barima e mu a toma, e man mu a kolon. Kɔnɔ wo tan a kolon, barima a sabatima wo i.»<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />«N mu wo raboloma xɛ de, wo xa lu alɔ kiridie. N man fama nɛ wo yire. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />A gbe mu luxi n xa lɔɛ duniɲa ma, kɔnɔ wo tan fama nɛ n tode. N tan to baloxi, wo fan baloma nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Wo a kolonma nɛ na lɔxɔɛ, a n tan nun n Baba nan a ra, wo fan nun n tan nan a ra, n fan nun wo tan nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Naxan n ma yaamarie suxuxi, a e rabatu, na kanyi nan n xanuxi. Anun, naxan na n tan xanuxi, n Baba a kanyi xanuma nɛ, n fan a xanu, n nan n yɛtɛ makɛnɛn a bɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yudasi, naxan mu findi Isikariyoti ra, a naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Marigi, munfe rabaxi i to fafe i yɛtɛ makɛnɛnde muxu tan bɛ, i mu i yɛtɛ makɛnɛn duniɲa tan bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Xa naxan yo n xanu, a n xui suxuma nɛ. N Baba a kanyi xanuma nɛ, muxu nun n Baba fa a yire, muxu sabati a i. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Naxan mu n xanuxi, a mu n xui suxuma. Wo masenyi naxan mɛfe n na, n gbe xa mu a ra. A fatanxi Baba Ala nan na, naxan n xɛɛxi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«N to wo ya ma, n bara na birin masen wo bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />kɔnɔ Baba Ala fama nɛ Saabui Fanyi xɛɛde wo yire n xili ra. Na saabui lanxi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan ma. Na nan fama wo ratude n ma masenyi birin na, a fa wo xaran na ra.»<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«N bɔɲɛsa fima wo ma naxan fatanxi n tan na, naxan mu kelixi duniɲa ma. Wo naxa kɔntɔfili, wo naxa gaaxu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Wo bara n xui mɛ, ‹N na sigafe, kɔnɔ n man fama wo yire›. Xa wo n xanu, a lanma wo xa sɛɛwa n ma sigɛ ra Baba Ala yire, barima a dangi n tan na. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />N a falaxi nɛ wo bɛ, beenun a xa raba, alako a na raba, wo xa danxaniya n ma.»<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />«N mu wɔyɛn gbegbe falama wo bɛ sɔnɔn, barima yi duniɲa na nɔla naxan yi, a na fafe. A mu nɔma n tan na a mɔɔli yo ra, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />kɔnɔ alako duniɲa xa a kolon a n tan Baba Ala xanuxi nɛ, Baba Ala n yamarixi naxan na, n a rabama nɛ. Wo keli, won xɛɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Sansi bili nun a salonyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«N misaalixi wuri bili nan na, n Baba Ala nan findixi a mɛɛnima ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Wuri bili salonyi naxee mu bogi raminima n bɛ, Ala e sɛgɛma nɛ. Salonyi naxee bogima, Ala xa e magbaran, alako e bogi xa gbo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Wo tan naxee findixi na salonyie ra, wo ɲan bara rasɛniyɛn n ma masenyi saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Wo lu n ma fe nɛ, alɔ n fan luma wo xa fe ki naxɛ. Sansi salonyi mu nɔma bogide a yɛtɛ ra xa a mu fatuxi sansi bili xa ma. Wo fan luma na ki nɛ, xa wo mu lu n ma fe. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />N tan nan na Ala xa sansi bili ra, wo fan findixi na sansi salonyie nan na. Naxan na lu n ma fe, n fan lu a xa fe, a lu nɛ alɔ sansi salonyi naxan a bogi gbegbe raminima. Xa wo nun n tan xa mu a ra, wo tan mu nɔma fefe ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Xa naxan mu lu n ma fe, a luma nɛ alɔ sansi salonyi masɛgɛxi naxan wɔlɛma, a xara. Walikɛe nee malanma nɛ, e e wɔlɛ tɛ xɔɔra, e gan. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Xa wo lu n ma fe, n ma masenyie fan lu wo bɔɲɛ ma, wo na wa fefe xɔn, wo a maxandi. A rabama nɛ wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />N Baba matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔma, wo tan na lu alɔ sansi salonyi naxee bogima a fanyi ra, wo a masen na wali fanyie kui, a wo findixi n fɔxirabirɛe nan na. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />N Baba Ala n tan xanuxi ki naxɛ, n fan wo xanuxi na ki nɛ. Wo lu n ma xanunteya kui. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Xa wo n ma yaamarie rabatu, wo luma n ma xanunteya kui, alɔ n fan luxi n Baba xa xanunteya kui ki naxɛ, n to a xa yaamarie rabatuxi.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«N yi fee masenxi nɛ wo bɛ, alako n ma sɛɛwɛ xa lu wo bɛ, wo xa sɛɛwɛ xa kamali.»<verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />«N ma yaamari findixi yi nan na: Wo wo bore xanu alɔ n wo xanuxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Xa mixi a nii fi a xanuntenyie xa fe ra, xanunteya yo mu na naxan dangi na tan na. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Wo tan findixi n xanuntenyie nan na, xa wo n ma yaamarie rabatu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />N mu fa nɔma a falade wo bɛ ‹konyie›, barima konyi mu a kolon a marigi naxan yo rabafe. N tan bara a fala wo bɛ ‹n xanuntenyie›, barima n naxan birin mɛxi n Baba ra, n bara wo rakolon a birin na. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Wo tan xa mu n sugandi. N tan nan wo sugandi, n wo findi n ma xɛɛrae ra, wo xa sa lu alɔ sansi salonyie naxee bogima, wo sa wali fanyie raba naxee mu kanama. Na kui, wo na fefe maxɔrin Baba Ala ma n tan xili ra, a a soma nɛ wo yi. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />N wo yamarixi nɛ yi fee ma, alako wo xa wo bore xanu.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duniɲa Isa fɔxirabirɛe xɔnfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Xa duniɲa wo xɔn, wo xa a kolon a n tan nan singe xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Xa wo findi duniɲa mixie nan na nu, wo rafanma nɛ duniɲa ma nu, alɔ a gbe mixie. Kɔnɔ duniɲa mixie mu wo ra, barima n tan bara wo sugandi e ya ma. Na nan a toxi, duniɲa wo xɔnxi. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Wo xa ratu wɔyɛnyi ma n naxan masen wo bɛ, ‹Konyi mu dangima a marigi ra.› Xa e bara n tan ɲaxankata, e wo fan ɲaxankatama nɛ. Xa e n tan xui suxu, e wo fan gbe suxuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />E yi fe birin niyama nɛ wo ra n tan xili xa fe ra, barima e mu n Xɛɛma kolon. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Xa n mu sa fa wɔyɛnde e bɛ nu, e mu yunubi sɔtɔma nu. Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, e mu fa nɔma sese falade naxan kiiti fanma e ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Naxan na n tan xɔn, a bara n Baba fan xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Xa n mu kaabanakoe raba e tagi nu naxee singe mu nu raba, e mu yunubi sɔtɔma nu. Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, e bara na birin to, e man fa n tan nun n Baba xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Kɔnɔ naxan sɛbɛxi e xa sɛriyɛ Kitaabui kui, fo a xa kamali, a to a masenxi, ‹E n xɔnxi nɛ tun.›»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«N Saabui Fanyi naxan xɛɛma wo ma kelife Baba Ala yire, naxan findixi Baba Ala Xaxili ra, naxan nɔndi makɛnɛnma, a tan na fa, a seede bama nɛ n ma fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Wo fan seede bama nɛ, barima wo na n fɔxɔ ra kabi a fɔlɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«N yi fe birin masenxi nɛ wo bɛ, alako wo naxa fa bira tantanyi kui. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />E fama nɛ tɔnyi dɔxɔde wo ma, sofe ra salidee kui. Waxati ɲan fafe, naxan na wo faxa, a na faxɛ maɲɔxunma kɛwali fanyi nan na Ala bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />E na fee rabama nɛ, barima e mu Baba Ala kolon, e mu n fan kolon. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Kɔnɔ n yi fee birin masenxi nɛ wo bɛ, alako e waxati na a li, wo xa ratu, a n e xa fe fala nɛ wo bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa wali</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«N mu yi fe birin masen wo bɛ a fɔlɛ ra, barima n nu na wo fɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, n fa sigafe n Xɛɛma yire, wo mu n maxɔrinma, ‹I na sigafe minden?› <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />N to yi fee masenxi wo bɛ, na nan wo bɔɲɛ sunnunxi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kɔnɔ n xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, n ma sigɛ nan munafanyi gbo wo bɛ, barima xa n mu siga, Saabui Fanyi mu fama wo ma. Kɔnɔ xa n siga, n a xɛɛma nɛ wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />A na fa, a mixie rakolonma nɛ yunubi xa fe ra, tinxinyi xa fe ra, nun kiiti xa fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />A e rakolonma nɛ yunubi xa fe ra, barima e mu danxaniyaxi n ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />A e rakolonma nɛ tinxinyi xa fe ra, barima n na sigafe Baba Ala yire, wo mu n toma fa. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />A e rakolonma nɛ kiiti xa fe ra, barima yi duniɲa na nɔla kobi naxan yi ra, a ɲan bara makiiti.»<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Masenyi gbɛtɛe man na, kɔnɔ wo mu nɔma e birin fahaamude yakɔsi. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ala Xaxili na fa wo ma, a na nɔndi birin ya mabɔɔma wo bɛ. A xa masenyi mu fatanxi a yɛtɛ kan na. A naxan mɛma n Baba ra, a na nan masenma wo bɛ. Fe naxee fama rabade, a nee nan masenma wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />A fama n ma xunnakeli makɛnɛnde, barima a naxan sɔtɔma n tan na, a na nan kawandima wo bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Naxan birin na Baba Ala yi, a findixi n fan gbe nan na. N a fala na nan ma, ‹A naxan sɔtɔma n tan na, a na nan kawandima wo bɛ.›»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sunnunyi masarama nɛ sɛɛwɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Isa man naxa a fala e bɛ, «Waxati di nan luxi beenun n xa lɔɛ wo ma, kɔnɔ waxati di man na dangi, wo man n toma nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />A fɔxirabirɛe naxa e bore maxɔrin, «Isa wama munse falafe yi ki, ‹A gbe mu luxi n xa lɔɛ wo ma dondoronti, kɔnɔ wo man fama n tode.› A xa wɔyɛnyi na di a to a falaxi, ‹N na sigafe Baba Ala yire?›» <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />E man nu e bore maxɔrinfe, «A munse ma, a ‹waxati di›? Won tan mu a kolon a sese falafe yi ki.»<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Isa to a kolon a e nu wama a maxɔrinfe, a naxa a masen e bɛ, «N to a falaxi, ‹Waxati di nan luxi beenun n xa lɔɛ wo ma, kɔnɔ waxati di man na dangi, wo man n toma nɛ,› wo wo bore maxɔrinfe na nan ma? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, wo wama nɛ, wo gbelegbele, kɔnɔ duniɲa tan ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ. Wo sunnunma nɛ na fe ma, kɔnɔ wo xa sunnunyi fama masarade sɛɛwɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ginɛ naxan na ditinyi ra, a tɔɔrɔma nɛ ki fanyi a xa waxati to bara a li. Kɔnɔ xa a gɛ di baride, a ɲan mu ratuma na tɔɔrɛ ma, a to sɛɛwaxi di nɛɛnɛ barife ra duniɲa. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Na kui, wo fan na sunnunyi nan kui yi waxati ma. Kɔnɔ n gbilenma nɛ wo to ra, wo bɔɲɛ sɛɛwa, mixi yo mu na sɛɛwɛ bama wo yi. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Na lɔxɔɛ na a li, wo mu n maxɔrinma sese ma sɔnɔn. N xa a fala wo bɛ a nɔndi ki ma, wo na Baba Ala maxandi fefe ma n xili ra, a a soma nɛ wo yi. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Han ya, wo singe mu nu Ala maxandi fefe ma n tan xili ra. Wo maxandi ti. Wo a sɔtɔma nɛ, alako wo xa sɛɛwa a kamalixi ra.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa xunnakeli makɛnɛnfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«N yi fe birin masenxi wo bɛ taali wɔyɛnyi nan na, kɔnɔ waxati na fafe, n mu wɔyɛnma wo bɛ taali wɔyɛnyi ra sɔnɔn, n Baba Ala xa fe masen wo bɛ a fiixɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Na waxati ma, wo Baba Ala maxandima n xili nan na. N mu a falafe xɛ de, a n tan nan Baba Ala maxandima wo bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />barima Baba Ala yɛtɛ yati wo xanuxi nɛ. A wo xanuxi nɛ n to rafan wo ma, wo man to laxi a ra a n kelixi a tan Ala nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />N kelixi Baba Ala nan ma, n fa duniɲa ma. N man fa kelife nɛ duniɲa ma, sigafe ra Baba Ala yire.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a fala a bɛ, «A mato, i mu wɔyɛnfe taali wɔyɛnyi xa ra sɔnɔn, i fa na wɔyɛnfe a fiixɛ nan na! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Muxu bara a kolon fa, a i fe birin kolon, hali mixi yo mu i maxɔrin. Na kui, muxu laxi a ra a i kelixi Ala nan ma.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Wo bara danxaniya yakɔsi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Waxati na fafe, a ɲan bara a li, wo yensenma nɛ, wo fa n nabolo. Kɔnɔ Baba Ala tan mu n naboloma. A luma nɛ n sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />N yi fe birin masenxi nɛ wo bɛ, alako bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo yi ra n saabui ra. Wo mantɔɔrɔli sɔtɔma nɛ duniɲa ma, kɔnɔ wo xa limaniya, n tan bara nɔ duniɲa ra.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Isa Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Isa to gɛ na fee falade, a naxa a ya rate koore, a a fala, «N Baba Ala, waxati bara a li. I xa i xa Di xa xunnakeli makɛnɛn, alako i xa Di fan xa i xa nɔrɛ makɛnɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />I bara mangɛya fi a ma duniɲa mixie birin xun na, alako a xa abadan kisi fi mixi birin ma, i naxee fixi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Abadan kisi findixi yi nan na: E xa i kolon, i tan keren naxan findixi Ala yɛtɛ ra, e man xa i xa Mixi Sugandixi Isa kolon i xa xɛɛra ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />N bara i xa nɔrɛ makɛnɛn duniɲa ma, n gɛ wali ra i n ti naxan na. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />N Baba Ala, yakɔsi, n nɔrɔ i fɛ ma, alɔ n nu nɔrɔxi i fɛ ma ki naxɛ, beenun duniɲa xa daa.»<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />«N bara i xa fe masen mixie bɛ, i naxee fixi n ma duniɲa. I xa mixie nan e ra i naxee taxuxi n na. E bara i xui ratinmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />E bara a kolon fa, a i naxan birin soxi n yi ra, a fatanxi i tan nan na, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />barima n bara i xui radangi e ma, e fan bara la a ra. E bara a kolon yati, a n kelixi i tan nan ma, e la a ra, a i tan nan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />N mu dubama duniɲa bɛ. N dubama i xa mixie nan bɛ, i naxee taxuxi n na. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Naxee birin findixi n gbe ra, i gbe na e ra. Naxee birin findixi i gbe ra, n gbe na e ra. N ma fe itema nɛ e tan saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />N mu fa luma duniɲa sɔnɔn. N fafe i yire nɛ yi ki, kɔnɔ e tan luma be nɛ. N Baba Sɛniyɛnxi, e makanta i xili sɛnbɛ ra, i naxan fixi n ma, alako e fan xa findi keren na alɔ won tan findixi keren na ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />N to nu e ya ma, n bara e kanta i xili sɛnbɛ ra, i naxan fixi n ma. N to e makanta, mixi keren mu lɔɛ e ya ma fo gbaloe ragataxi naxan keren bɛ, alako Kitaabui sɛbɛli xa kamali. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Kɔnɔ n to fafe i yire nɛ yi ki, n yi fee falama duniɲa ma, alako n ma sɛɛwɛ xa lu e bɛ, a xa lu e bɔɲɛ ma a kamalixi ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />N to i xa masenyi fala e bɛ, duniɲa bara e xɔn, barima e tondixi birade duniɲa fe fɔxɔ ra alɔ n fan to mu tinxi birade duniɲa fe fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />N mu i maxandima xɛ i xa e tongo duniɲa ma. N i maxandife nɛ i xa e ratanga Sentanɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />E mu birama duniɲa fe fɔxɔ ra, alɔ n fan to mu luma na fe mɔɔli kui. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />I xa e sa i yɛtɛ nan sagoe nɔndi kui. I xui nan findixi nɔndi ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />N bara e xɛɛ duniɲa, alɔ i fan n xɛɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />N bara n yɛtɛ sa i sagoe e bɛ, alako e tan fan, e xa sa i sagoe nɔndi kui.»<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«N mu dubama na mixie gbansan xa bɛ. N man dubama mixie bɛ naxee fama danxaniyade n ma e saabui ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />N dubama nɛ e bɛ alako e xa findi keren na, alɔ n nun i tan n Baba Ala findixi keren na ki naxɛ. N man dubama e bɛ alako e xa findi keren na won fɔxɔ ra, won birin xa findi keren na. Na kui, duniɲa nɔma a kolonde a i tan nan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />I bara xunnakeli naxan fi n ma, n fan bara a fi e ma, alako e fan xa findi keren na, alɔ won tan findixi keren na ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />N tan na e i, i fan na n i, alako e xa kerenɲa xa kamali. Na kui, duniɲa a kolonma nɛ a i tan nan n xɛɛxi, a i man e tan xanuxi alɔ i n fan xanuxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«N Baba Ala, beenun duniɲa xa daa, i nu bara nɔrɛ fi n ma i xa xanunteya xa fe ra. A xɔli n ma n ma mixie, i naxee fixi n ma, nee fan xa lu n sɛɛti ma ariyanna, e xa n ma nɔrɛ to. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />N Baba, i tinxin. N i kolon. Duniɲa tan mu i kolon, kɔnɔ e a kolon a i tan nan n xɛɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />N bara e rakolon i xa fe ra, n man nde sama nɛ a fari, alako xanunteya xa lu e bɔɲɛ ma i n xanuxi naxan na, alɔ n fan na e bɔɲɛ i ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Isa suxufe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matiyu 26:47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maraki 14:43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luki 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Isa to gɛ Ala maxandide, a tan nun a fɔxirabirɛe naxa siga Sediron xure naakiri ma sansi yire. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yudasi, naxan findi Isa yanfama ra, a fan nu na kolon, barima Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛe nu darixi e malan na mɛnni nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yudasi naxa Rɔmakae, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie, nun Farisɛnie xa sɔɔri gali xanin naa, lanpuie nun geresosee na e yi ra. E man naxa sɛxɛ maxiri wuri ma, e a radɛxɛ alako e xa kira to. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Isa to nu fe birin kolon naxan nu fafe a lide, a naxa e ralan, a e maxɔrin, «Wo nde fenfe?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />E naxa a yaabi, «Muxu Isa Nasarɛtika nan fenfe.» Isa naxa a fala, «N tan nan na a ra.» Yudasi, naxan findi a yanfama ra, a fan nu tixi na gali ya ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Isa to a fala e bɛ, «N tan nan na a ra», e naxa gbilen xanbi, e bira bɔxi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Isa man naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo nde fenfe?» E man naxa a yaabi, «Isa Nasarɛtika.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «N bara a fala wo bɛ, n tan nan a ra. Xa wo n tan nan fenfe, wo a lu yi booree tan xa siga.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Na kui, Isa xa masenyi nan nu fafe kamalide, a to nu bara a fala, «I mixi naxee fi n ma, keren mu lɔɛ e ya ma.»<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a xa santidɛgɛma ramini, a sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa konyi Maliku yirefanyi tuli bolon. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Isa naxa a fala Simɔn Piyɛri bɛ, «Santidɛgɛma raso a tɛɛ i. Fo n xa tin tɔɔrɛ ra Baba Ala naxan nagiri n ma.»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xaninfe Anani nun Kayafa yire</para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri a yɛtɛ rasanfe Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Rɔma sɔɔri mangɛ nun a xa sɔɔrie, a nun Yuwifie xa sɔɔrie naxa Isa suxu, e a xiri, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />e a xanin Anani xɔn ma. Anani xa di ginɛ nan dɔxɔ Kayafa xɔn. Kayafa nu bara findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi ra na ɲɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa nan nu bara Yuwifi kuntigie rasi, a a fan e bɛ, mixi keren nan xa faxa ɲama bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa bira Isa fɔxɔ ra, a nun Isa fɔxirabirɛ gbɛtɛ nde. Na fɔxirabirɛ to nu findixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi kolon mixi ra, a naxa nɔ sode sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa tɛtɛ kui, e Isa xanin dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Piyɛri naxa lu tande naadɛ dɛ ra, han a boore, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi kolonma, a naxa wɔyɛn naadɛ kantama ra a xa tin Piyɛri fan xa so. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Konyi ginɛ naxan nu naadɛ kantafe, a naxa Piyɛri maxɔrin, «Na xɛmɛ Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde xa mu i fan na?» A naxa a yaabi, «Ade, n tan mu a ra!» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Xinbeli to mini, konyie nun kɔsibilie naxa tɛ xuru, e fa lu na fɛ ma. Piyɛri fan naxa a maso e ra.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi naxa Isa maxɔrin a fɔxirabirɛe xa fe ma, a nun a xa kawandie. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «N tan masenyie tixi kɛnɛ nan ma, duniɲa birin bɛ. N nan n ma kawandi birin tixi salidee nan kui, xa na mu hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, Yuwifie birin e luma malan na dɛnnaxɛ. N mu sese fala dunxui ra. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />I n tan maxɔrinma munfe ra? Naxee n xui ramɛ, nee nan maxɔrin. E tan nan a kolon n bara fee naxee fala.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Isa to na fala, kɔsibili nde naxan nu tixi naa, a naxa a dɛ ragarin, a a fala, «Pe, I sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi yaabima na ki nɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Xa n wɔyɛn kobi nan falaxi, a masen. Kɔnɔ xa n mu wɔyɛn kobi xa falaxi, i n dɛ ragarinxi munfe ra?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Na tɛmui, Anani naxa a xirixi rasanba Kayafa ma, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xunyi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simɔn Piyɛri nu dɔxɔxi tɛ ra, a na a maxarafe. Na tɛmui e naxa a maxɔrin, «Isa fɔxirabirɛ xa mu i fan na?» Piyɛri naxa e yaabi, «Ade, a fɔxirabirɛ mu na n tan na.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xa konyi nde nu na naa, Piyɛri nu bara naxan barenyi tuli bolon. A naxa Piyɛri maxɔrin, «N mu i to xɛ na sansi yire, wo nun Isa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Piyɛri man naxa na matandi, konkore fan naxa a rate keren na.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa tife gomina Pilati ya i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matiyu 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:-1-14">11-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maraki 15:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luki 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Na tɛmui, e naxa Isa tongo Kayafa xɔnyi, e a xanin gomina xɔnyi. Kuye nu baxi ibade. Yuwifi kuntigie tan mu tin sode gomina xɔnyi, alako e xa sɛniyɛnyi naxa fa kana, e mu fa nɔ Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali donyi donde. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Na kui, gomina Pilati naxa mini e yire tande, a e maxɔrin, «Wo yi xɛmɛ kalamufe munse ma?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />E naxa a yaabi, «Xa yi xɛmɛ mu findi fe kobi raba xa ra, muxu mu fama a ra i xɔn ma nu.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilati naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo a xanin, wo xa sa a makiiti wo xa sɛriyɛ ki ma.» Yuwifie naxa a fala, «Wo xa sɛriyɛ mu tinma muxu xa mixi faxa muxu yɛtɛ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Na kui, Isa xa wɔyɛnyi nan nu fafe kamalide, a to nu bara a yɛtɛ faxa ki masen.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilati man naxa so a xɔnyi, a Isa xili, a a maxɔrin, «I tan nan findixi Yuwifie xa mangɛ ra?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «I wɔyɛnfe i yɛtɛ xaxili nan ma ba, ka mixie nan n ma fe fala i bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilati naxa a yaabi, «Pe, Yuwifi nan na n fan na? I boore Yuwifie nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nan i saxi n bɛlɛxɛ. I munse rabaxi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «N ma mangɛya mu findixi duniɲa daaxi xa ra, xa na mu a ra n ma mixie gere soma nɛ nu, e tondi n xa lu Yuwifie sago. N ma mangɛya mu findixi duniɲa daaxi ra.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Na kui, Pilati naxa a maxɔrin, «I tan nan na Yuwifie xa mangɛ ra?» Isa naxa a yaabi, «I tan nan a falaxi. N barixi nɛ duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari, alako n xa nɔndi masen a birin bɛ. Mixi naxan wama nɔndi xɔn, a n xui suxuma nɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilati man naxa a maxɔrin, «Nɔndi na di?» Pilati to na fala, a naxa mini tande Yuwifie yire, a a fala e bɛ, «N mu fe ɲaaxi yo toxi yi xɛmɛ lan a xa ɲaxankata naxan ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Wo to darixi a ra n xa geelimani keren bɛɲin wo bɛ Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali lɔxɔɛ, wo wama n xa Yuwifie xa mangɛ bɛɲin wo bɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />E naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, «Ade, na mu a ra! Barabasi nan xa rabolo.» Suute nan nu Barabasi ra.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Isa faxafe natɛ tongo ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Na tɛmui Pilati naxa yaamari fi a sɔɔrie xa Isa bulan sɛbɛrɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Sɔɔrie naxa mangɛ katanyi maniyɛ yailan tunbee ra, e a sa a xun ma, e fa mangɛ donma gbeeli ragoro a ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />E nu e masoma a ra, e nu a fala, «I kɛna, Yuwifie xa mangɛ,» e nu fa a madin.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilati man naxa mini tande, a a fala Yuwifi ɲama bɛ, «N bara yi xɛmɛ masen wo bɛ, alako wo xa a kolon a n mu fefe toxi a ma a ɲaxankatama naxan ma.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Na kui, sɔɔrie naxa Isa ramini tande, na tunbe mangɛ katanyi saxi a xun ma, burumusi gbeeli ragoroxi a ma. Pilati naxa a fala e bɛ, «A tan nan yi ki!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi kɔsibilie to a to, e naxa sɔnxɔ, «A faxa! A banban wuri magalanbuxi ma!» Pilati naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo a tongo, wo tan nan xa sa a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma, barima n tan mu fefe toxi a lan a xa faxa naxan ma.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yuwifie naxa a yaabi, «Sɛriyɛ na muxu fan yi. Na sɛriyɛ ki ma, a lan a xa faxa, barima a bara a yɛtɛ findi Ala xa Di ra.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilati to na mɛ, a naxa gaaxu ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />A man naxa so a xɔnyi, a Isa maxɔrin, «I tan, i kelixi minden?» Kɔnɔ Isa mu yaabi yo fi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilati naxa fa a fala a bɛ, «I tondixi n tan nan yaabide? I mu a kolon a nɔɛ naxan na n tan bɛ, n nɔma i rabolode, n man nɔma i faxade wuri magalanbuxi ma?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Nɔɛ yo mu i bɛ n tan xun ma fo Ala naxan fixi i ma. Na nan a ra, naxan n saxi i bɛlɛxɛ, na nan xa yunubi gbo.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilati to na mɛ, a naxa so katafe a xa Isa rabɛɲin, kɔnɔ Yuwifie naxa sɔnxɔ, «Xa i yi xɛmɛ bɛɲin, i bara gere giri Rɔma mangɛ xungbe ma. Naxan yo a yɛtɛ findi mangɛ ra, a bara ti Rɔma mangɛ xungbe kanke.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Na kui, Pilati to e xui mɛ, a naxa Isa ramini tande. Pilati naxa dɔxɔ buntunyi ra, kiitisa kibanyi kui, dɛnnaxɛ xili falama Eburu xui «Gabata». <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Na lɔxɔɛ Yuwifie nu na fee yailanfe Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa fe ra. Yanyi tagi Pilati naxa a fala Yuwifie bɛ, «Wo xa mangɛ nan ya!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />E man naxa sɔnxɔ, «A faxa! A faxa! A banban wuri magalanbuxi ma!» Pilati naxa a fala, «N xa wo xa mangɛ faxa wuri magalanbuxi ma?» Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa a yaabi, «Mangɛ yo mu na muxu tan bɛ bafe Rɔma mangɛ xungbe ra!» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Na tɛmui a naxa Isa sa e sagoe, a yaamari fi Isa xa banban wuri magalanbuxi ma.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Isa banbanfe wuri magalanbuxi ma</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matiyu 27:32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maraki 15:21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luki 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Sɔɔrie to Isa suxu, <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />e naxa a ramini taa kui sigafe ra «xun konkota yire,» naxan xili falama Eburu xui «Gologota.» Isa naxa siga naa, a wuri magalanbuxi ratexi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />E Isa banban wuri magalanbuxi ma mɛnni nɛ. E naxa mixi firin gbɛtɛ fan banban, e keren ti yirefanyi ma, e boore ti kɔɔla ma, e Isa ti e tagi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilati naxa yaamari fi a yi sɛbɛli xa gbaku Isa xun ma wuri magalanbuxi ma, «Isa Nasarɛtika, Yuwifie xa mangɛ». <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yuwifi gbegbe naxa na sɛbɛli xaran, barima Isa nu banbanxi dɛnnaxɛ, na makɔrɛ taa ra. Na sɛbɛli fan nu sɛbɛxi Eburu xui, Latɛni xui, a nun Girɛki xui. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Na kui, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa a fala Pilati bɛ, «I naxa a sɛbɛ ‹Yuwifie xa mangɛ›. I xa a sɛbɛ nɛ, ‹Yi xɛmɛ a fala nɛ, a Yuwifie xa mangɛ nan a ra.›» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilati naxa e yaabi, «N naxan sɛbɛxi, n bara gɛ na sɛbɛde.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Sɔɔrie to gɛ Isa banbande, e naxa a xa dugie tongo, e e itaxun na sɔɔri naani ma. E naxa a xa donma fari igoroe fan tongo. Na donma to mu nu dɛgɛxi, <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />e naxa a fala e bore bɛ, «Won naxa a ibɔɔ. Won xa a tongoma sugandi bere nde ra.» Na birin naba nɛ, alako naxan sɛbɛxi Kitaabui kui, na xa rakamali:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">«E bara n ma dugie itaxun e bore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">e n ma donma tongoma sugandi bere ra.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Sɔɔrie a raba na ki nɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Isa nga fan nu na a xa wuri magalanbuxi fɛ ma, a nun a nga xunya. Kolopa xa ginɛ Mariyama, nun Mariyama Magidalaka fan nu na mɛnni. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Isa to a nga to a fɔxirabirɛ maxanuxi fɛ ma, a naxa a fala a nga bɛ, «N nga, yi bara findi i xa di ra.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />A naxa fa a fala a fɔxirabirɛ fan bɛ, «A mato, i nga nan ya.» Keli na waxati ma, na fɔxirabirɛ naxa Isa nga xanin a xɔnyi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matiyu 27:45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maraki 15:33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luki 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Na xanbi, Isa to nu a kolon a fe birin bara kamali, a naxa a fala, «Ye xɔli na n ma.» A na fala nɛ alako Kitaabui xa masenyi xa kamali. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Se sase nde nu na mɛnni, naxan nu rafexi wɛni muluxunxi ra. E naxa se nde rasin na wɛni i, e a xiri hisopi wuri kuye ra, e a maso Isa dɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />A to nde min, a naxa a fala, «A birin bara kamali!» A naxa a xun sin, a fa laaxira.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Na lɔxɔɛ Yuwifie nu see rafalama Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa fe ra. E mu tin furee xa lu wuri magalanbuxi ma na malabu lɔxɔɛ, barima sali xungbe nan nu a ra. Na kui, e naxa Pilati mayandi a xa na mixi banbanxie sanyie gira, alako e xa faxa mafuren, e xa ba na. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Sɔɔrie naxa fa, e fa na mixi firinyi sanyie gira, naxee nu banbanxi Isa yirefanyi ma, a nun a kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Kɔnɔ e to Isa li, e naxa a to a ɲan bara faxa. Na kui, e mu a tan sanyie gira, <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />kɔnɔ sɔɔri nde naxa a sɛɛti sɔxɔ tanbɛ ra, ye nun wuli naxa mini keren na. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Naxan na fe toxi, a bara na fe seede ba. A xa seedeɲɔxɔya findixi nɔndi nan na. A tan yɛtɛ a kolon, a a na nɔndi nan falafe wo bɛ, alako wo fan xa danxaniya. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Na fee raba nɛ alako Kitaabui xa masenyi xa kamali, naxan a masenxi, «A xɔri keren mu girama.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />A man sɛbɛxi yire gbɛtɛ, «E e ya tima nɛ mixi ra, e bara naxan sɔxɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa xa maragatɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-66">Matiyu 27:57-66</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maraki 15:42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luki 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Na fe birin xanbi, Yusufu Arimateka naxa sa Isa fure maxandi Pilati ma. Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde nan nu a ra, kɔnɔ a mu nu a masenma kɛnɛ ma, a to nu gaaxuxi Yuwifi kuntigie ya ra. Pilati to tin, Yusufu naxa sa Isa fure tongo. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemu, naxan nu bara siga Isa yire gundo kui kɔɛ ra tɛmui dangixi, na fan naxa labundɛ kilo tongo saxan miri nun alowe daaxi xanin Isa fure yire. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />E naxa Isa fure mafilin dugie ra, e labundɛ sa a ma, alɔ Yuwifie darixi a ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Bɔxi nde nu makɔrɛ Isa faxade ra, gaburi nɛɛnɛ nu bara yailan dɛnnaxɛ. Fure yo mu nu ragataxi a kui sinden. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />E naxa Isa ragata na yire makɔrɛxi, barima e gbataxi Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali xa fe ra. A nu lan nɛ Yuwifie xa gɛ fe birin yailande beenun kɔɛ xa so na lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Isa xa marakeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matiyu 28:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maraki 16:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luki 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Sande lɔxɔɛ Mariyama Magidalaka naxa siga gaburi yire subaxɛ ma beenun kuye xa mayalan. A to mɛnni li, a naxa a to na gɛmɛ xungbe nu bara ba gaburi dɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Na kui, a naxa siga a gi ra Simɔn Piyɛri nun Isa fɔxirabirɛ boore yire, Isa nu naxan xanuxi, a a fala e bɛ, «E bara Marigi fure tongo gaburi kui, muxu fan mu a kolon e a saxi dɛdɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Na kui, Piyɛri nun Isa na fɔxirabirɛ boore fan naxa mini sigafe ra gaburi yire. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />E firinyi naxa siga e gi ra, kɔnɔ Isa fɔxirabirɛ maxanuxi naxa gaburi li beenun Piyɛri singe xa naa li. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />A to a felen alako a xa gaburi kui mato, a naxa kasange dugie to, kɔnɔ a mu so na kui. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simɔn Piyɛri to mɛnni li, a naxa so fɔnmɛ kui keren na, a fa dugi bentenyi to naxan nu saxi Isa fure ma, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />a nun dugi naxan nu makunfukunfuxi Isa yatagi ma. Na dugi nu saxi a xati ma, a sa ki yailanxi a fanyi ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Na tɛmui, Isa fɔxirabirɛ boore, naxan singe gaburi yire li, a fan naxa so na kui. A naxa a birin to, a danxaniya. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />E mu nu fahaamui sɔtɔxi Kitaabui xa masenyi ma sinden, fa fala a fo Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa keli faxɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Na dangi xanbi na fɔxirabirɛ firinyie naxa gbilen e xɔnyi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa minife Mariyama Magidalaka ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maraki 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariyama to nu tixi gaburi sode dɛ ra, a nu na wafe. A to a felen a xa gaburi kui mato, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />a naxa malekɛ firin to. E maxirixi dugi fiixɛ ra, e dɔxɔxi Isa fure nu saxi dɛnnaxɛ. Keren nu na a xunsade ra, boore nu na a sanlaabe ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />E naxa Mariyama maxɔrin, «N ma di, i wafe munfe ma?» A naxa e yaabi, «E bara n Marigi fure tongo, n mu a kolon e a saxi dɛdɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />A to gɛ na falade, a naxa a kobe rato, a fa mixi nde to, a tixi naa. A mu a kolon a Isa nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Isa naxa a maxɔrin, «N ma di, i wama munfe ra? I na nde fenfe?» Mariyama ɲɔxɔ a ma, sansi mɛɛnima nan nu a ra. Na kui, a naxa a yaabi, «N ba, xa i tan nan na fure tongoxi, i xa na yire masen n bɛ alako n xa siga a tongode.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Mariyama.» Mariyama to a mafindi, a naxa a ratin, «Rabuni!» Na nan falaxi Eburu xui, «Karamɔxɔ». <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «I naxa i bɛlɛxɛ din n na, barima n mu nu te Baba Ala yire sinden. Siga n ngaxakerenyie yire, i a fala e bɛ, a n fafe tede n Baba xɔnyi, n Marigi Ala naxan findixi wo fan Baba ra, wo fan Marigi Ala.»<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariyama Magidalaka naxa siga xibaaru ra Isa fɔxirabirɛe yire, a a fala e bɛ, «N bara Marigi to!» A man naxa Isa xa xɛɛra iba e bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa minife a fɔxirabirɛe ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matiyu 28:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maraki 16:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luki 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Na sande lɔxɔɛ kerenyi, Isa fɔxirabirɛe nu malanxi banxi kui nunmare ra, naadɛ birin mabalanxi Yuwifi kuntigie xa yaragaaxui ma. Isa naxa mini e ma, a ti e tagi, a a fala, «Ala xa wo bɔɲɛ sa.» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />A to na fala e bɛ, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛe nun a sɛɛti masen e bɛ. E naxa sɛɛwa Marigi tofe ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Isa man naxa a masen e bɛ, «Bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo bɛ. N bara wo xɛɛ alɔ Baba Ala n xɛɛxi ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />A to gɛ na falade, a naxa foye felun e ma, a a fala, «Wo xa lu Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa goro wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Xa wo diɲɛ mixi haakɛ ma, na haakɛ bara ɲɔn, kɔnɔ xa wo mu diɲɛ, na haakɛ luma a ma.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tomasi Isa tofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Isa mini a xa xɛɛra fu nun firinyie ma tɛmui naxɛ, Tomasi, e naxan xilima «guli», a mu nu na e ya ma mɛnni. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Na kui, booree naxa a fala a bɛ, «Muxu bara Marigi to!» Kɔnɔ a tan naxa e yaabi, «Xa n tan mu lantuma fɔxi to a bɛlɛxɛ kui, n nan n bɛlɛxɛsole raso naa, xa n man mu n bɛlɛxɛ sa a sɛɛti ma e dɛnnaxɛ sɔxɔ, n tan mu lama a ra feo!»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Xi solomasaxan dangi xanbi, Isa fɔxirabirɛe man to nu malanxi banxi kui, Tomasi nu na e ya ma. Hali naadɛ birin to nu mabalanxi, Isa naxa mini e ma mɛnni, a ti e tagi, a e xɛɛbu, «Bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo bɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Na tɛmui, Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bɛlɛxɛ mato. I xa i bɛlɛxɛsole sa n sɛɛti ma e dɛnnaxɛ sɔxɔ. I naxa tɛgɛ n i. I xa danxaniya.» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi naxa a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi Ala!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Isa naxa a masen a bɛ, «I danxaniyaxi nɛ, i to bara n to? Hɛɛri na mixie bɛ naxee bara danxaniya, hali e mu n toxi.»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yi Kitaabui sɛbɛ fe naxan ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Isa kaabanako gbegbe raba nɛ a fɔxirabirɛe ya xɔri, naxee mu sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Kɔnɔ naxee xa fe tan sɛbɛxi yi ki, e sɛbɛxi nɛ alako wo xa la a ra, a Isa nan na Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, Ala xa Di. Na kui, wo na danxaniya a ma, wo kisi sɔtɔma nɛ a saabui ra.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Isa minife a fɔxirabirɛ ndee ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Na fee dangi xanbi, Isa man naxa mini a fɔxirabirɛe ma Tiberiyasi baa dɛ ra. A a yɛtɛ makɛnɛn e bɛ yi ki nɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simɔn Piyɛri, Tomasi e naxan xilima «guli,» Natanayɛli naxan keli Kaana taa Galile bɔxi ma, Sebede xa die, nun Isa fɔxirabirɛ firin gbɛtɛe, nee birin nu na yire keren. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simɔn Piyɛri naxa a fala e bɛ, «N tan sigafe yɛxɛ suxude.» E naxa a fala a bɛ, «Won birin na a ra.» Na kui, e naxa mini, e baki kunkui kui, kɔnɔ na kɔɛ birin na, e mu sese suxu.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kuye to nu ibafe, Isa nu tixi baa dɛ ra, kɔnɔ a fɔxirabirɛe mu nu a kolon a a tan nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Isa naxa e maxɔrin, «N ma die, wo bara yɛxɛ nde sɔtɔ?» E naxa a yaabi, «Ade, muxu mu sese suxuxi.» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo yɛlɛ woli kunkui yirefanyi ma, wo a nde sɔtɔma nɛ.» E to a woli, e mu nu nɔma yɛlɛ ratede, barima yɛxɛ gbo a kui. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Na kui, Isa fɔxirabirɛ, a naxan xanuxi, a naxa a fala Piyɛri bɛ, «Won Marigi na a ra.» Simɔn Piyɛri to na mɛ, a naxa donma ragoro a ma, a bagan ye ma sigafe ra Isa yire. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Booree fan naxa a li kunkui kui, yɛlɛ naxan nafexi yɛxɛe ra, a xirixi kunkui ra. E mu nu makuya xare dɛ ra, fo nɔngɔn kɛmɛ firin ɲɔndɔn.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />E to te xare dɛ ra, e naxa tɛ xuruxi to, yɛxɛ saxi a tɛ wole ra, taami fan na na. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo fa yɛxɛ nde ra wo baxi naxan suxude.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Na kui Simɔn Piyɛri naxa te kunkui kui, a yɛlɛ bɛndun xare ma. A nu rafexi yɛxɛ xungbee nan na, a gundi kɛmɛ tongo suuli nun saxan. Kɔnɔ hali yɛxɛ to nu gboxi yɛlɛ kui na ki, yɛlɛ mu ibɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Isa naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo fa wo dɛge.» A fɔxirabirɛe mu suusa a maxɔrinde nde a ra, barima birin nu a kolon Marigi nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Isa naxa fa taami tongo, a a itaxun e ma, a man naxa yɛxɛ so e yi ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />A saxan nde nan nu na ki, Isa a yɛtɛ masenma a fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, kabi a keli faxɛ ma.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun Piyɛri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />E to gɛ e dɛ ibade, Isa naxa Simɔn Piyɛri maxɔrin, «Simɔn, Yaya xa di, i n xanuxi dangi yee birin na?» A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, Marigi. I tan a kolon n i xanuxi ki naxɛ.» Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Mɛɛni n ma yɛxɛɛ yɔrɛe ma.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />A man naxa gbilen a maxɔrin na a firin nde, «Simɔn, Yaya xa di, i n xanuxi?» A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, Marigi. I tan a kolon n i xanuxi ki naxɛ.» Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Mɛɛni n ma yɛxɛɛe ma.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />A man naxa gbilen a maxɔrin na a saxan nde, «Simɔn, Yaya xa di, i n xanuxi?» Piyɛri naxa sunnun Isa to a maxɔrin sanmaya saxan nde, «I n xanuxi?» A naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, i tan fe birin kolon. I tan a kolon n i xanuxi ki naxɛ.» Isa naxa a fala a bɛ, «Mɛɛni n ma yɛxɛɛe ma. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />N xa nɔndi yati nan fala i bɛ, i fonike tɛmui, i tan nan nu i yɛtɛ tagi ixirima, i wa sigafe dɛdɛ, i siga. Kɔnɔ i na fori, i i bɛlɛxɛ italama nɛ, mixi gbɛtɛ i tagi xiri, a i xanin yire i mu wama sigafe dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Isa na fala nɛ alako a xa Piyɛri faxa ki nan masen, Piyɛri fama Ala matɔxɔde naxan saabui ra. A na fala xanbi, a naxa a fala Piyɛri bɛ, «Bira n fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa nun a fɔxirabirɛ maxanuxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Piyɛri to a kobe rato, a naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛ to e fɔxɔ ra, Isa nu naxan maxanuxi. Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali, a tan nan a maso Isa ra e dɛge tɛmui, a a maxɔrin, «Marigi, nde fama i yanfade?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Piyɛri to a to, a naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Marigi, na tan go?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Isa naxa a yaabi, «Xa n wama a xa simaya xa bu han n gbilen tɛmui, na munse fanma i tan ma? I tan xa bira n fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Na kui, danxaniyatɔɛ ndee ɲɔxɔ naxa lu a ma a na fɔxirabirɛ tan mu faxama, kɔnɔ Isa mu na fala. A a fala nɛ, «Xa n wama a xa simaya xa bu han n gbilen tɛmui, na munse fanma i tan ma?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛbɛli dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Na fɔxirabirɛ yati nan yi fe birin sɛbɛ, a findi seede fanyi ra. Muxu a kolon a xa seedeɲɔxɔya findixi nɔndi nan na.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Isa fe gbegbe raba nɛ naxee mu sɛbɛxi yi Kitaabui kui. Xa na birin sɛbɛ nɛ nu, n laxi a ra a na Kitaabuie birin sade mu sɔtɔma duniɲa ma nu.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>